INSERT INTO `quest_request_items` (`ID`,`EmoteOnComplete`,`EmoteOnIncomplete`,`EmoteOnCompleteDelay`,`EmoteOnIncompleteDelay`,`CompletionText`,`VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(29548,0,273,0,0,'Ah, a veteran of the Cataclysm campaigns! Good, I could use more experienced hands.',57689),
(29552,0,0,0,0,'We will remember all the brave Alliance soldiers who fell today. Though they can no longer continue, we carry the fight onward.',27326),
(29555,0,0,0,0,'Well?',0),
(29558,0,0,0,0,'You fight well, foreigner.',27326),
(29559,0,0,0,0,'Are they freed?',27326),
(29560,0,0,0,0,'The skulls are precious to my tribe. How many have you collected?',27326),
(29577,0,0,0,0,'What is that jinyu up to over there?',27356),
(29580,0,0,0,0,'Were there any tools left?',27326),
(29581,0,0,0,0,'Yes, did you need something?',0),
(29585,0,0,0,0,'Best not to judge our prized cider by its flavor in this state.',27326),
(29587,0,0,0,0,'Those ropes should give with a strong tug.',27326),
(29600,0,0,0,0,'<Yue sighs.>$B$BIf only we\'d kept up with our maintenance, the situation would not have come to this.',27356),
(29619,0,0,0,0,'Are you ready for the banquet? I can\'t wait.',27326),
(29620,0,0,0,0,'We will move on to the training soon enough, young $c. First, we must talk, and drink, and eat.$b$bThough I must say, I admire your discipline.',27326),
(29624,0,0,0,0,'What are you waiting for?',27326),
(29627,0,0,0,0,'<Wu looks at you expectantly.>',27326),
(29628,0,0,0,0,'She really is a nice woman. And an excellent cook.$b$bThe best cook in the world, actually.',27326),
(29629,0,0,0,0,'It is said that the ancient herbalism masters were able to remove 20 vials of extract from each blossom.',27326),
(29630,0,0,0,0,'Very recently, I was walking in the Waxwood, when one of these sprites got on all fours behind my knees, evading my notice. Soon afterward, a second sprite approached me from the front, shoving me forcefully in the chest. Unaware of the first sprite, I stepped backwards, only to stumble on his prostrate form and fall, embarrassingly, onto my backside.$b$bSo yes, I have a vested interest in this assignment.',27326),
(29631,0,0,0,0,'Please, do not speak of our arrangement with others. My cowardice shames me.',27326),
(29632,0,0,0,0,'You may be a hero in your own lands, but here, you must prove your worth.',27326),
(29633,0,0,0,0,'Zhi-Zhi\'s style is different than that of most pandaren monks. He and his kind tend to have more... energy... than us.',27326),
(29634,0,0,0,0,'I do not know why he decided to take the monastic path so late in life. It is not my place to ask. Such questions fall under the responsibility of our Spirit-Sage.',27326),
(29635,0,0,0,0,'Young Xiao has a great future in martial arts. I wish you luck in your upcoming match.',27326),
(29637,0,0,0,0,'Good luck, $n.',27326),
(29670,0,0,0,0,'We are ready to fight the mogu leader whenever you are.',27326),
(29690,0,0,0,0,'',57388),
(29716,0,0,0,0,'Where is Shin? I didn\'t see Shin.',27326),
(29717,0,0,0,0,'Wow! You are tough!',27326),
(29749,0,0,0,0,'Spirit-binding! How can the mogu have been allowed to resume such a disgusting practice?! And now here I am, the product of a half-failed conjuring...$B$B<The spirit fumes for a moment, then turns to you.>$B$BWhat century is this?',0),
(29750,0,0,0,0,'To think the mogu have continued training the Spiritclaws for all these years...$B$BDid you get the bottles?',27326),
(29751,0,0,0,0,'Have you found the items we need for the ritual? We cannot guide these spirits back without them.',27326),
(29752,0,0,0,0,'We mustn\'t forsake the wayward dead.',27326),
(29753,0,0,0,0,'Do not fear for the spirits of the beasts - they will find peace here.',27326),
(29756,0,0,0,0,'Even the dead know hunger.',27326),
(29757,0,0,0,0,'"It just ain\'t a party without Bottletoads!"$B$BHmm... no, that doesn\'t work.$B$B"Bottletoads: not as gross as they sound!"',27356),
(29759,0,0,0,0,'Did you find him?',27326),
(29762,0,0,0,0,'We still grieve for our fallen brothers.',27326),
(29765,0,0,0,0,'You got me goods, mon?',0),
(29815,0,0,0,0,'I hope you were successful. Our survival here may depend on it.',0),
(29865,0,0,0,0,'The silkwood stalkers are not in balance with nature. Predators are one thing but these creatures kill for pleasure. Harmony must be restored.',27326),
(29866,0,0,0,0,'Did you find the Silkwood?',27326),
(29877,0,0,0,0,'Man, those virmen is dumb.',27356),
(29879,6,0,0,0,'Wikket got slickies... for me!?',0),
(29881,0,0,0,0,'There is only a small window of time after each petal falls that it may be used to achieve the perfect hue.',27326),
(29882,0,0,0,0,'Have you been able to acquire some stingers? I would normally ask a monk for help with this but they all seem to be elsewhere at the moment.',27326),
(29883,0,0,0,0,'If we can win over the jinyu, they may allow us to stay.',27326),
(29885,0,0,0,0,'Time is short. Each hour we delay, the White Pawn may move further away.$B$BWhere are the supplies I asked for?',27326),
(29887,0,0,0,0,'The Elder is a Waterspeaker. He speaks to the waters, and they answer.',27326),
(29891,0,0,0,0,'The mists seem to have a mind of their own, do they not?',0),
(29892,0,0,0,0,'Watch your step in the swamp, my new friend.',0),
(29893,0,0,0,0,'Have you collected all the ingredients? It is almost time to make the Dream Brew.',0),
(29898,0,0,0,0,'Perhaps I could bring some of these healing waters back to Stormwind with me.',27326),
(29899,0,0,0,0,'The howls are lessening... already.',27326),
(29900,0,0,0,0,'Did you... find the scroll?',0),
(29903,0,0,0,0,'The jinyu are skilled in different ways. It is up to us to find their strengths.',27326),
(29904,0,0,0,0,'How are those trainees looking?',27326),
(29910,0,0,0,0,'The marmots won\'t be happy when you try to fill in their holes.',27356),
(29911,0,0,0,0,'Do I smell turnips?',0),
(29913,0,0,0,0,'It hurts my ears to hear their hungry squeals.$b$bOnce you\'ve been a pig rancher for a while, you can distinguish hungry squeals from regular squeals.',27356),
(29914,0,0,0,0,'Have you found them? There should be three missing, I think.',27356),
(29915,0,0,0,0,'Oh... you have one of my... my lambs?',0),
(29916,0,18,0,0,'I wish I were brave enough to fight them, but...',27356),
(29917,0,0,0,0,'What will Master Shang say when he finds out?',27356),
(29918,0,0,0,0,'You lack fear. I can sense it in your heart.',0),
(29920,0,0,0,0,'Each of the pandriarchs earned their reputation in life and retained them afterward.  I can\'t even imagine how you will defeat them.',27326),
(29925,0,0,0,0,'Ah, hello again, $p! You received my message, then?',0),
(29926,0,0,0,0,'Never thought nibblers would be a big enough threat to choke up the whole mine.',27326),
(29928,0,0,0,0,'<Mann looks at you expectantly, eyes wide and nostrils flared.>',27326),
(29933,0,0,0,0,'Slicky food!',0),
(29937,0,0,0,0,'You didn\'t touch that stuff with your hands did ya?',0),
(29939,0,0,0,0,'I have yet to face a crisis that couldn\'t be fixed with dynamite.',0),
(29940,0,0,0,0,'If my father wants his vegetables, I\'m going to need your help.',27356),
(29942,0,0,0,0,'Wikket grook all them ookin\' snappers?',0),
(29944,0,0,0,0,'The virmen here have strange habits. Stranger names.',27356),
(29945,0,0,0,0,'You have the stuff ready for the paint? I went ahead and gathered some turnips.',27356),
(29946,0,0,0,0,'Ready when you are, $n.$b$bYou go ahead. I\'ll meet you down there.',27356),
(29947,0,0,0,0,'Go, torment those virmen, $n!',27356),
(29948,0,0,0,0,'I done told those virmen to stay off my land.',27356),
(29951,0,0,0,0,'I knowed you for a friend as soon as I seen you.',27356),
(29952,0,0,0,0,'...',27356),
(29968,0,0,0,0,'Gotta watch out for the wet ones...whewee!',0),
(29981,0,0,0,0,'If the flying mantid troops have always been able to fly over, why haven\'t they before now?',27366),
(29982,0,0,0,0,'Once these mantid are slain, we can get to work repairing the wall and restoring the town to its normal state.',27366),
(29984,0,0,0,0,'If you cannot pass this test, then there is probably no reason to continue our training.',27366),
(29985,0,0,0,0,'Living outside of society has its advantages. I can focus all my energies on training, without being shackled to the societal conventions of modesty, politics, and basic personal hygiene. Here in the woods, I am free to be myself.',27366),
(29986,0,0,0,0,'See if you can light one of the wards while one of the mist incarnations is nearby.',27366),
(29987,0,0,0,0,'I\'m prepared, $n. Are you?',27366),
(29988,6,6,0,0,'How is your egg hunt going?',27366),
(29989,0,0,0,0,'This test will be trying. You will test the strength of your fists against the strength of stone. Steel yourself, $n.$b$bNot literally, of course.$b$bUnless you normally wear steel gloves... in which case, you may literally steel yourself.',27366),
(29992,0,0,0,0,'Ow! Ow! Ow!',27366),
(29997,0,0,0,0,'The pools are clouded. I will need my staff to calm the spirits and speak to the water.',27326),
(29999,0,0,0,0,'I hope they didn\'t give you too much trouble.',27326),
(30001,0,0,0,0,'I can see the moths eating the pages from here!',27326),
(30002,0,0,0,0,'My stomach is too fragile to handle the squashing of bugs. Is it done?',27326),
(30005,0,0,0,0,'I love to see fireworks lighting up the sky!',27326),
(30028,0,0,0,0,'Between birds and sprites we are never going to meet our quota to the Stormstout Brewery.',27356),
(30029,0,0,0,0,'Oh good, they didn\'t turn you into a frog yet. I saw them do that once you know.',27356),
(30030,0,0,0,0,'Oh why? Why did I have to tamper with the natural order of things? All I wanted was to make these grains grow faster and more numerous.',27356),
(30031,0,0,0,0,'None of this seems to taste sweet enough! What\'s the deal?',27356),
(30032,0,0,0,0,'That jungle sounds spooky.',27356),
(30050,0,0,0,0,'Water my plants you lazy $c!',27356),
(30051,0,0,0,0,'That Stormstout feller says that he\'s the best brewer that ever was. Might be true, couldn\'t tell ya one way or the \'nother as of yet.',27356),
(30052,0,0,0,0,'',27356),
(30054,0,0,0,0,'You bring back those teeth, and maybe Mung-Mung will have some hops for you.',27356),
(30058,0,0,0,0,'Have you vanquished the beast?',27356),
(30072,0,0,0,0,'Have you found all of the items? Did you pay close attention to our process?',27356),
(30073,0,0,0,0,'It takes more than three seconds to make beer, $n. Even when your name is Chen Stormstout.',27366),
(30075,0,0,0,0,'This brewery - it\'s a disgrace to the Stormstout name! Something needs to be done!',27366),
(30076,5,5,0,0,'This is gonna be great. It\'ll be just like makin\' beer, but instead of water, I\'m gonna use water sprite meat.',27366),
(30077,0,0,0,0,'Barrels.',27366),
(30078,0,0,0,0,'Let\'s do this.',27366),
(30079,0,0,0,0,'Something definitely not right! Pandaren supposed to be HAPPY!',27366),
(30081,0,0,0,0,'Can\'t believe Ken-Ken did not think of this sooner. It\'s the ONE thing that can ruin his day...',27366),
(30083,0,0,0,0,'We cannot let the saurok walk all over us anymore.',27366),
(30088,0,0,0,0,'<Ken-Ken is hard at work carving something out of tree bark.>$B$BThis gonna be great, you\'ll see.',27366),
(30089,0,0,0,0,'This must be the emperor\'s sad coming back! That is some oooold sad.$B$BKen-Ken bet pandaren sad get stronger with age, too, like pandaren booze.',27366),
(30091,0,0,0,0,'I don\'t know why this is happening, but I can say for certain that those elementals were the start of it all.',27366),
(30117,0,0,0,0,'Greetings, $c.',0),
(30135,0,0,0,0,'The Order rarely meddles with the natural balance on this island, but it is too important to save the serpents.',27326),
(30136,0,0,0,0,'Did you return the hatchlings to their nests?',27326),
(30137,0,0,0,0,'The saurok keep the stolen serpent eggs in their camp.',27326),
(30140,0,0,0,0,'The wild cloud serpents live in a delicate balance with nature. Their rare eggs are quite vulnerable to enemies.',0),
(30168,0,0,0,0,'I think they even stole my holy spittoon. ',27366),
(30169,0,0,0,0,'Slovan has always been a nuisance, but with the Crane Temple\'s defenses down he has become a true threat.',27366),
(30181,0,0,0,0,'They didn\'t send ya\' runin\' did they?',27366),
(30182,0,0,0,0,'I used to go on fox hunts with my father. If he could see me now! Hunting in Pandaria!',27366),
(30183,0,0,0,0,'What\'s your count up to?',27366),
(30184,0,0,0,0,'Puttin\' the "big" into "Big Game Hunter."',27366),
(30185,0,0,0,0,'I\'ve always been livin\' in me father\'s shadow. But after today, folks are gonna remember the name of Nesingwary, Jr.!',27366),
(30252,0,0,0,0,'I really wasn\'t cut out for this type of work. I didn\'t exactly grow up in the country.',27356),
(30254,0,0,0,0,'Well, go ahead - bust that soil up and plant the seeds!$B$BYou aren\'t giving up already are you? I need your help!',27356),
(30256,0,0,0,0,'Look at those... err, what do they say around here? Oh yeah, b\'yoots!$B$BLook at those b\'yoots!$B$BI think I\'m getting the hang of this farmer thing.',27356),
(30257,0,0,0,0,'Hey, haven\'t seen your face around here before! What\'s your name?',0),
(30267,0,0,0,0,'I refuse to not fish. Fishing\'s who I am!',27356),
(30268,0,0,0,0,'<Anduin is focused intently on his hands, swiftly carving venom glands from the snakes.>$B$BInside the jaw... two inches behind the second set of fangs...',27366),
(30270,0,0,0,0,'We cannot risk any more saurok ambushes, but we\'re in no position to take them on in force. Fortunately, with you here, we shouldn\'t need to.',27366),
(30271,0,0,0,0,'Look for Crane Wing pandaren who are falling to despair and slay sha near them while I support you!',27366),
(30272,0,0,0,0,'We shouldn\'t press further into the temple before clearing out some of the sha presence outside.',27366),
(30344,0,0,0,0,'It is one thing to research the lost dynasties. It is quite another to visit their ancient ruins.$b$bI am giddy as I have not felt in centuries!',27366),
(30346,0,0,0,0,'<You sense the presence of Lorekeeper Vaeldrin, then hear his voice within your mind.>$b$bHmm. I\'m still not sure about these references to "torture" regarding the Pools of Youth.',27366),
(30347,0,0,0,0,'Nothing like being mortal to give one a sense of urgency.',27366),
(30349,0,0,0,0,'Kang has been sharing stories with me about these mogu.$b$bApparently ages ago they ruled as emperors subjugating all free races of Pandaria and the surrounding regions. Now they are little more than hoodlums.$b$bTo see these mogu fight though, I suspect they are trying to rekindle some of their older ideals and ambitions.',27366),
(30350,0,0,0,0,'Mama Bramblestaff always said Squirmy Delight will cure any hunger one way or another.',27366),
(30351,0,0,0,0,'I have never seen the mogu this numerous before. They have always been a nuisance but never this bad.',0),
(30352,0,0,0,0,'As far as I\'m concerned, paying you to kill these birds is the same as me shooting them myself. You just get to be my gun as it were.',27366),
(30353,0,0,0,0,'I like hunting with Nesingwary and all but he\'s in it for the hunting. I\'m in it for the profit, and he doesn\'t pay us.',27366),
(30354,0,0,0,0,'I will not have my people condemned to slavery and torture at hands of the mogu.',27366),
(30355,0,0,0,0,'Every artifact in our possession is one less weapon in mogu hands.',27366),
(30356,0,0,0,0,'We cannot hope to beat these mogu if their numbers keep growing.',27366),
(30357,0,0,0,0,'These mantid are a much bigger threat than I think even the pandaren give them credit for.',27366),
(30359,0,0,0,0,'Lyalia is the only family I have left. I had to bury her mother during the war of Ahn\'Qiraj.',27366),
(30361,0,0,0,0,'It has been many thousands of years since mantid were seen on this side of the Great Wall.',27366),
(30363,0,0,0,0,'Did you find the scout?',0),
(30384,0,0,0,0,'Did you find the tauren scout? Our presence must be kept a secret. The horde can NOT know we are here.',27366),
(30457,0,1,0,0,'If the war leader of the yaungol is slain, surely our village will be saved and the refugees will be able to return to their farms.',27377),
(30459,6,6,0,0,'How many arrows do you have?',27377),
(30460,0,1,0,0,'There are yet more injured warriors in need of aid, $c.',27377),
(30468,0,396,0,0,'Are they dead?',27377),
(30469,0,0,0,0,'Have you found the supplies?',27377),
(30480,0,6,0,0,'That... was not what I expected.',27377),
(30489,0,0,0,0,'Mmm. Nothing like the fresh scent of needle.',27377),
(30491,0,0,0,0,'The grummles always insist they have better luck with cleaned yaks.$b$bAs long as they pay more I\'m not going to argue. We need the gold. Now more than ever.',27377),
(30495,0,0,0,0,'Did you deliver the jade in time?',27326),
(30496,396,396,0,0,'Have you found the staff?',27377),
(30500,0,0,0,0,'This, it seems, is only the tip of the iceberg, $n.',27326),
(30502,0,0,0,0,'Do you have the jade, $n?',27326),
(30512,0,0,0,0,'I will not rest until our people are returned and this village rebuilt.',27377),
(30514,0,0,0,0,'As long as Ur-Bataar lives, we cannot have peace.',27377),
(30535,0,0,0,0,'How\'d it go, partner? Did you get those seeds from Groanfur?$B$BErr... Greenfield?',27356),
(30565,0,0,0,0,'Did ye find my missing gears and bolts?',27326),
(30568,0,0,0,0,'Is everyone in order and ready to move?',27326),
(30571,0,6,0,0,'Look, $g mister : lady;, I don\'t mean to be telling you your business, but I can still see a lot of my farmhands still out there.',27377),
(30575,0,274,0,0,'It\'s going to take more yaks than that to get this place back into fightin\' condition, $n, yes it is.',27377),
(30581,6,6,0,0,'Do you have everything from the list?!',27377),
(30582,0,0,0,0,'Oh, and what have you there.',0),
(30583,6,6,0,0,'Well... ya\' got my meat?',27377),
(30593,0,6,0,0,'Please tell me that you have the Mogujia situation under control. Please?',27377),
(30595,6,6,0,0,'Where am I going to be able to put all of the relics?',27377),
(30599,0,0,0,0,'Hozen are learning that it is most bad fortune to get sacrificed on one\'s own altar.',27377),
(30600,0,0,0,0,'Grummles are a simple people. We are made to explore and deliver.',27377),
(30601,0,1,0,0,'Did you find the hiding guides?',27377),
(30603,0,0,0,0,'Grummles named for the luckydo that gives the most fortune to specific grummle. It is most important that hozen not steal a grummle\'s luck.',0),
(30604,0,0,0,0,'This is not vengeance or fortune, it is survival.',27377),
(30607,0,0,0,0,'A luckydo would be wise to never travel near a yeti on a dirty yak.',27377),
(30608,0,0,0,0,'Other grummles say I not have good luck. The call me "Luckydon\'t".$b$bBut now I have friend $r who is a big luckydo! We\'ll show them.',27377),
(30610,0,0,0,0,'Grummles are good at carrying things.',27377),
(30611,0,0,0,0,'We found a yak. Did you take out some hozen?',27377),
(30614,0,0,0,0,'Yaungols are scary. Yaungols with a luckydo like this "oil" are more scary.',27377),
(30616,0,0,0,0,'A luckydon\'t travels a trail during a yaungol raid. A luckydo hires a big fighter type to help.',27377),
(30618,0,0,0,0,'Did you manage to get some of my supplies back?',27377),
(30619,0,6,0,0,'Did you find him? Is he dead? No? Oh, man. Don\'t make me worried!',27377),
(30621,0,0,0,0,'Were you able to find my lucky trinkets? One can never have too much good luck.',27377),
(30622,0,0,0,0,'Look at the SIZE of that thing...',27366),
(30625,0,0,0,0,'',27366),
(30651,0,6,0,0,'I\'m a wee bit surprised by the lack o\' explosions I\'ve seen so far.$B$BAre you well?',27377),
(30665,0,0,0,0,'Have you dealt with the yaungol yet?',27377),
(30666,0,0,0,0,'What would make the crocs attack like this?',27366),
(30667,0,0,0,0,'<A bead of sweat twinkles in the fur above Tony\'s brow.>',27366),
(30668,0,0,0,0,'You got the stuff? I\'ll build your raft, I just need materials.',27366),
(30670,0,0,0,0,'Have you harvested their essences?',27377),
(30671,0,0,0,0,'My hunger is great, $r. I have been on this lagoon for several days, without food.',27366),
(30675,0,0,0,0,'This must be it!',0),
(30683,0,396,0,0,'Nephew Bentnail has already eaten two days worth of food. I hope you found us more!',27377),
(30690,0,396,0,0,'Is Malevolent Fury gone?',27377),
(30691,0,0,0,0,'Please, $n. Even the great beasts of this world have a right to die in dignity.',27366),
(30694,0,0,0,0,'Well, I don\'t see any spikes in your face. That\'s a good sign.',27366),
(30695,0,0,0,0,'Koro said there\'s a pagoda on either side of the temple. Let\'s find them and wipe out the sha presence in both.',27366),
(30715,0,0,0,0,'Our comrades, are they at rest?',27377),
(30723,0,5,0,0,'Killing those birds may not soothe my anger, but at least it proves that we are better than our enemies. They would not do such a thing.',27377),
(30742,0,0,0,0,'I shoulda never fed them goots.',27377),
(30743,0,0,0,0,'On the bright side, Uncle Keenbean can label the last batch of Kafa\'goot as "Limited Release" and sell it for even more!',27377),
(30744,0,0,0,0,'<This should be more than enough berries to satisfy Uncle Keenbean.>',0),
(30745,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t wanna fight yetis? Can\'t say I blame you.',27377),
(30746,0,0,0,0,'Kota Kon wants more kafa, but I already fed her all I have! Then I tried giving her a nice bow, but she\'s not satisfied!$B$B<The terrified grummle gulps and leans in close to whisper.>$B$BI think she can smell the kafa I drank for breakfast...',0),
(30747,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t push our luck... we promised her hozens-smashies.',27377),
(30750,0,0,0,0,'Come on, come on.',27377),
(30751,0,0,0,0,'Do you have the oil?',27377),
(30771,0,0,0,0,'The yaungol are not content merely to defeat their enemies. No, they would rather destroy and decimate them.',0),
(30772,0,0,0,0,'I like to attack problems head on.',27377),
(30773,0,0,0,0,'Fire is a cruel weapon. Luckily, we are only using it to destroy weapons of war.',27377),
(30774,0,0,0,0,'How did it go?',27377),
(30775,0,0,0,0,'How could they have betrayed me? They were once my brothers!$B$BWhy did they turn on me? WHY?$B$BI hate them! I will slaughter them all!',27377),
(30776,0,0,0,0,'Jung Duk\'s legacy is written in the blood of innocents.',27377),
(30778,0,0,0,0,'The stench of death is overpowering.',27377),
(30779,0,0,0,0,'It is better to be safe than sorry.',27377),
(30780,0,0,0,0,'I do believe the totems could be of use to us.',27377),
(30783,0,0,0,0,'Our people are possessed by hatred. We must help them come to their senses!',27377),
(30784,0,0,0,0,'If I could change the past, I would. If I could take Lin\'s place, I would.$B$BIn a thousand lifetimes, I will never be able to repay Suna\'s loss, or share even a measure of her grief.',27377),
(30786,0,0,0,0,'I will not die before having my revenge.',27377),
(30787,0,0,0,0,'I can use these torches in my revenge.$b$bI have not succumbed to this wound yet. I can still have my revenge before I die.$b$bThere is time yet.',27377),
(30788,0,0,0,0,'Golgoss is no coward. He will relish the opportunity for revenge.',27377),
(30789,0,0,0,0,'Arconiss\' size belies his prowess in battle. He will be an asset.',27377),
(30790,0,0,0,0,'Golgoss\' hunger is great.',27377),
(30791,0,0,0,0,'Our preparation will not take much longer.',27377),
(30792,0,0,0,0,'I require more mist. I am fading...',27377),
(30796,0,0,0,0,'Have you disposed of the spirits yet?',27377),
(30797,0,0,0,0,'What have you found, $n?',0),
(30798,0,0,0,0,'Have you gone to the Tomb of Secrets yet?',27377),
(30799,0,0,0,0,'Did you find anything in the Tomb of Shadows?',27377),
(30800,0,0,0,0,'Have you figured out where the Thunder King\'s remains are hidden?',27377),
(30801,0,0,0,0,'Have you read the tablet?',27377),
(30802,0,0,0,0,'Were you able to find any information on their location?',27377),
(30804,0,0,0,0,'So many strangers in these lands these days. Luckily you $c seem to be all right.',27377),
(30805,0,0,0,0,'Are they dead? Have you dealt with them?',27377),
(30806,0,0,0,0,'Are those the ingredients for Incense of Life I smell on you? Or... perhaps you haven\'t bathed recently.',27377),
(30807,0,0,0,0,'The stones - have you brought them?',27377),
(30808,0,0,0,0,'A luckydo is a thing of much good fortune. Yaungol know nothing of how to use luckydos... yet.',27377),
(30814,0,0,0,0,'We are slowly gaining ground.',27377),
(30820,0,0,0,0,'You must light the incense to honor the dead.',27377),
(30829,0,0,0,0,'I\'ll need to bind my essence to the Tongue, then you can use it to speak with me from anywhere.',27377),
(30888,0,1,0,0,'The defenders on the wall are stretched thin. The Yaungol are pushing through the gates to Kun-Lai in the north. The mantid are pouring against the gates to the Vale of Eternal Blossoms. I hear that there\'s been a breach into the Valley of Four Winds in the south too.$B$BWe do not have the men to combat all of these threats.',27377),
(30889,0,1,0,0,'These traps have been very effective, the mantid numbers are just getting out of hand in these past weeks.',27377),
(30890,0,1,0,0,'This whole battlefront is being worked to the bone. We need more men out here.',27377),
(30891,1,1,0,0,'Mixed properly, the pollen from these flowers can eat away at the poison without doing any lasting damage to the body otherwise.',27377),
(30892,0,1,0,0,'With the constant mantid attacks, the men are being worked to the bone. We are undermanned on all fronts.$B$BYour help means a lot to us, $n.',27377),
(30893,0,1,0,0,'Our vigil is never-ending.',27377),
(30894,1,1,0,0,'I\'m hoping to find a permanent counter to the mantid poison so that the men won\'t be afflicted in the first place. It may take some time to piece it together.',27377),
(30895,1,1,0,0,'Back even more quickly than expected. Did you bring the seeds?',27377),
(30896,0,1,0,0,'I haven\'t hated plants so much since my job back at Halfhill.',27377),
(30897,1,1,0,0,'My mom warned me this was going to happen...',27377),
(30898,0,1,0,0,'I can\'t remember the last time they swarmed this thickly. They probably haven\'t within my lifetime.',27377),
(30899,1,0,0,0,'Another wave of fliers approaches. Be ready.',0),
(30922,0,0,0,0,'It\'s messy work, certainly.$b$bNowhere near as messy as digging graves.',27377),
(30925,0,0,0,0,'Niuzao does not move quickly, nor does he make rash decisions. Perform his task, and give him time to decide.',27377),
(30927,0,0,0,0,'I should have gone with them.',27377),
(30928,0,0,0,0,'Even among our own order, only a few chosen elders knew of our sacred duty to contain the Sha of Fear.$b$bWhy they chose to tell the yak-keeper, I may never know.',27377),
(30929,0,0,0,0,'This yak is not a good yak. Not at all.',27377),
(30930,0,0,0,0,'See? I told you! No good yaks.',27377),
(30931,0,0,0,0,'Did... did you find it?',27377),
(30932,0,0,0,0,'Any luck?',27377),
(30942,0,1,0,0,'I\'ll show my father he\'s wrong about me!',27377),
(30943,1,1,0,0,'Were you able to find a suitable amount of volatile blooms?',27377),
(30944,0,1,0,0,'Are the villagers recovering?',27377),
(30945,0,0,0,0,'We\'ll need more than luck to get us through this. I hope you found something I can work with.',27377),
(30946,0,1,0,0,'What did the prisoner have to say?',27377),
(30963,0,0,0,0,'I refuse to let one of our kind fall just because of a broken set of armor.',27377),
(30964,0,0,0,0,'Any luck out there, $n?',27377),
(30967,0,0,0,0,'If we can rescue the dissenters, perhaps we can rebuild somewhere else...',27377),
(30970,0,1,0,0,'The Sha of Hatred\'s passing did this to them. I doubt this is the only thing that will have been affected by its passing.',27377),
(30971,1,1,0,0,'The pandaren at the bridge are depending on us...',27377),
(30972,1,0,0,0,'Welcome to the mess.',0),
(30973,0,1,0,0,'Creative solution.  Lao-Chin impresses.',27377),
(30977,0,1,0,0,'Our vigil continues...',27377),
(30991,0,0,0,0,'Wha? I was just thinking about my poor, poor beer...',27377),
(30993,0,0,0,0,'Here we are, then.',27377),
(31005,0,0,0,0,'Without nourishment, I will die where I stand.',27377),
(31007,0,0,0,0,'They have forsaken our ways and they will pay dearly for it.',27377),
(31008,0,0,0,0,'The bladesworn carry their swords with pride. I want them on my weapon racks!',27377),
(31011,0,1,0,0,'The village must be saved!',27377),
(31020,0,0,0,0,'I have been sleeping for many thousands of years. I must regain my strength before rejoining the Council.',27377),
(31021,0,0,0,0,'Do you understand, Wakener? The amber gives life.',27377),
(31022,0,0,0,0,'What has happened to our home? Things feel amiss.',27377),
(31023,0,0,0,0,'What do you have there?',0),
(31026,0,0,0,0,'The swarm knows not of their terrible folly! These precious trees must be protected at all costs!',27377),
(31032,0,1,0,0,'Some of them can make it through the smoke, but in small enough numbers that we can easily pick them off.',27377),
(31058,0,0,0,0,'These hozen pack some mean toys and some meaner brews.',27366),
(31065,0,1,0,0,'Go. Look.',27377),
(31066,0,0,0,0,'The order stands. Slay the fallen paragon.',27377),
(31067,0,6,0,0,'Azzix, his name was. I think. Azzix K\'tai.',27377),
(31068,5,0,0,0,'Is that some sort of scroll?$b$bWould you mind if I took a look?',0),
(31069,0,0,0,0,'You needn\'t look far to find shade around here, friend.',27377),
(31070,0,0,0,0,'I wonder how we\'ll mix those things into the brew? Can\'t grind them up - that\'d be too gritty.$b$bMaybe I\'ll just soak \'em for a while.',27377),
(31071,0,0,0,0,'Did you find them? Can it be?',27377),
(31072,0,0,0,0,'I think I\'m starting to understand the next few lines of this prophecy, $n.$b$bDo you have the daggers yet?',27377),
(31073,0,0,0,0,'We don\'t brew with wood here. It gives the brew a harsh, insipid flavor, not unlike that of wine.$b$b<Vu spits.>',27377),
(31074,0,0,0,0,'<Lya looks concerned.>',27377),
(31078,0,0,0,0,'I think I see someone over there, but I can\'t seem to get across these amber beams.',27377),
(31079,0,0,0,0,'We hate being eaten.',27377),
(31080,0,0,0,0,'I haven\'t been able to catch any of those things!',27377),
(31082,0,0,0,0,'The collection pit is down the hill, just to the west of here.',27377),
(31084,0,0,0,0,'...',27377),
(31085,0,0,0,0,'Make sure to bring that forked blade with you.',27377),
(31086,0,0,0,0,'Any luck?',27377),
(31088,0,1,0,0,'Have the harvesters been punished?',27377),
(31090,1,1,0,0,'I would go with you to gather amber, but my talents are more useful here.',27377),
(31107,0,0,0,0,'Kypari Vor was beautiful once. Rich with amber and surrounded by prime hunting grounds.',27377),
(31108,0,0,0,0,'Do you have the crystals?',27377),
(31110,0,0,0,0,'Did you find the powders?',27377),
(31112,0,0,0,0,'You manage to get your hands on them supplies, $gpal:toots;?',0),
(31129,0,0,0,0,'You are brave to have come across the wall, $r.',27377),
(31130,0,420,0,0,'There is nothing like a little manual labor to bring strangers together, don\'t you think?',27326),
(31133,0,0,0,0,'Can\'t stand those mantid.',27377),
(31176,0,0,0,0,'The juices of the starfish will clear my mind.',27377),
(31177,0,0,0,0,'I have much work to do. The sooner I can fight, the sooner I can return to the Council.',27377),
(31178,0,0,0,0,'By drinking the blood of your enemies, you acquire their strength.',27377),
(31181,0,0,0,0,'What\'s wrong, green? You aren\'t afraid of the dark, icy sea are you?',27377),
(31182,0,0,0,0,'In the words of my old deck boss: "Do what I say, \'cause I said it!"',27377),
(31184,0,0,0,0,'To be honest, I hope a grouper ate the old charter.$B$BWait, then it might end up here anyway. Dang it!',27377),
(31185,0,0,0,0,'Dog deserves all the freedom the sea has to offer him - I\'ve tried to set him free, but he won\'t go.$B$BBest we can do anymore is take him out for walks now and then.',27377),
(31186,0,0,0,0,'<This has got to be the most pathetic lion seal you\'ve ever seen.>',27377),
(31187,0,0,0,0,'You smell that, green?$B$B<Arie takes a big, dramatic whiff of rank, fishy air.>$B$BSmells like money!',27377),
(31188,0,0,0,0,'Having actually seen someone eaten by a thresher, I\'m not sure why you\'d willingly string their teeth around your neck, but whatever.',27377),
(31189,0,0,0,0,'Go give Ju Lien a hand, would ya?',27377),
(31228,0,0,0,0,'Is Khar\'zul dead?',27377),
(31230,0,0,0,0,'Any luck?',27326),
(31241,0,0,0,0,'Whatcha got, wikket?',0),
(31254,0,0,0,0,'More strangers? This day is testing my limits.',0),
(31255,0,0,0,0,'More strangers? This day is testing my limits.',0),
(31260,0,0,0,0,'I thought about taking that tiger on myself but to be honest I like living...',27366),
(31262,0,0,0,0,'I watched that bird stab a tiger through the face. What kind of place is this where birds are the predators for tigers?',27366),
(31265,0,0,0,0,'No, I don\'t have a "chaser!" Just drink it!',27377),
(31281,0,0,0,0,'Show me that you can follow instructions.',0),
(31285,0,0,0,0,'It is always good luck to have a grummle aboard when traveling through a saurok infested cave.',27356),
(31286,0,0,0,0,'Saurok are seldom this bold.',27356),
(31287,0,0,0,0,'It is unwise to challenge the domain of Madam Goya.',27356),
(31319,0,0,0,0,'My thoughts will be with your companions, $n.$b$bMay they be made whole again soon.',27326),
(31394,0,0,0,0,'Are you finished with the White Tiger\'s tasks?',27377),
(31398,0,0,0,0,'Where did you find this?',0),
(31486,0,0,0,0,'You have a letter for me?',0),
(31606,0,0,0,0,'<cough cough>$B$BMy head...',27377),
(31611,0,0,0,0,'Ah, still alive I see...',27377),
(31660,0,0,0,0,'Let me know if you want to be dropped into a sea of swarmborn. It would entertain me greatly.',27377),
(31676,0,0,0,0,'The mogu of Clan Gurthan are quilen lords. Do not wake their guardians.',27377),
(31687,0,6,0,0,'How did it go?',27377),
(31688,0,6,0,0,'Did you find him?',27377),
(31732,0,5,0,0,'What are you waiting for?! Scorch the ground beneath them!',27326),
(31735,0,0,0,0,'We will complete our mission, but right now our priority is that warlock!',27326),
(31738,0,0,0,0,'It is easier to harbor hatred than to make peace.',27326),
(31741,0,0,0,0,'Gol\' dang, but there\'s a bunch of \'em down there...',27326),
(31742,0,0,0,0,'Pretty scary-lookin\' characters around here...',27326),
(31743,0,0,0,0,'What\'s that you\'ve got, $glad:lass;? Some kind o\' flare?$b$bShoot, I coulda put together a better flare\'n that in half a wink, if Rell had only asked.',27326),
(31744,0,0,0,0,'Those poor, wee little cubs. Go, help \'em out, $n. Do what\'s right.',27326),
(31765,0,5,0,0,'What are you waiting for?! Get on those guns!',58911),
(31766,0,0,0,0,'What?',61265),
(31809,0,0,0,0,'<Ban looks at you with narrowed eyes.>\n\nSomething about you is... different. Changed.',0),
(31945,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t overlook the scallion. It may be small and innocuous, but it creates truly marvelous flavors.',0),
(32038,0,0,0,0,'How goes the hunt?',27366),
(32045,0,0,0,0,'',27356);
INSERT INTO `quest_offer_reward` (`ID`,`Emote1`,`Emote2`,`Emote3`,`Emote4`,`EmoteDelay1`,`EmoteDelay2`,`EmoteDelay3`,`EmoteDelay4`,`RewardText`,`VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(29548,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s a whole Horde base down there! Where was our intel?$B$BWell $c, it\'s time to see what this upgraded gunship is capable of.',57689),
(29552,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work, $n. Those soldiers will live and fight another day because of your efforts.',27326),
(29553,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<You found him, but the Admiral is unconscious. He looks on the verge of death.>',27326),
(29555,483,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Alright... let me see... using the cipher from when the ship went missing...\n\n<Nodd is clearly doing some calculations in his head.>\n\nAha!',27326),
(29556,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work. Dirty creatures trying to kick us when we\'re down... \n\nThat\'ll teach \'em to try and salvage an Alliance vessel!',27326),
(29558,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ahahaha! You are brave.$B$BAn admirable trait.',27326),
(29559,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have freed my brothers? Good.$B$BWe are in your debt.',27326),
(29560,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is good to see that you are so resourceful, $n. It is a trait admired by my people.$B$BThe fine specimens you have brought me will produce powerful magic.',27326),
(29562,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. Because of you, we were able to make it here safely.',27326),
(29576,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'If you\'ve come to speak with my fists, take your place in line. Otherwise, I could use your help.',27326),
(29577,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I can\'t believe he was able to see that with a stick... perhaps there is more to "crazy jinyu rituals" than we thought.',27356),
(29578,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nice work, but there\'s more to be done if we are to save this village.',27326),
(29579,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They\'re inside. Shaken, but alive thanks to you.',27326),
(29580,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There are no $cs among us, but we\'ll fight to protect our loved ones.',27326),
(29581,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah... dreamleaf! So you want to see the Golden Dream, do you?$B$BCome to think of it, I haven\'t seen the Dream in years - not since I was a cub spending long hours playing in the pools. Long before I took up the culinary arts.$B$BLooks like you brought enough dreamleaf for two cups of tea... so why not?$B$BHere\'s to better days!',27356),
(29585,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A survivor came in moments ago and said the flames are beginning to die down.$B$BWe owe our very way of life to you, stranger. I cannot possibly reward you adequately, but please take this.',27326),
(29586,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This doesn\'t look like a quick snatch and run. They\'re setting up for something big.',27326),
(29587,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The pandaren were subjected to mogu rule in ancient times - we\'ll never let it happen again.',27326),
(29600,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have my gratitude, $n.$B$BPlease take this as a token of my appreciation.',27356),
(29617,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve arrived at an exciting time. High Elder Cloudfall has agreed to take on a new class of trainees within the monastery. This could be my big chance to finally learn how to fight!',27326),
(29618,396,396,396,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to Tian Monastery. I see young Lin has helped you understand the role we fill here in our hilltop village.$b$bWe are unaccustomed to outsiders. You would do us a great honor to train alongside our younglings. We do not have anything to offer you, $c... except knowledge, and perhaps an appreciation of what it means to be pandaren.',27326),
(29619,1,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These will do perfectly. What a thoughtful gift, $n!$b$bMe? I\'m bringing beer, of course.',27326),
(29620,396,396,6,0,0,0,0,0,'That concludes our introductions. You should be ready to begin your training.$b$bThat is... you should be ready to begin your training... AFTER we have one more mug of ale. Perhaps two. Shall we, $n?',27326),
(29622,6,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,'First, you drink too much beer... and then you show up to class late? Looks like you\'ve already conformed to pandaren culture.$b$bLet\'s begin.',27326),
(29623,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This isn\'t your first time fighting, is it? Your form isn\'t perfect, but it is certainly practiced.',27326),
(29624,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You may not be a full-time trainee here, but do not let that keep you from learning anything.$b$bI can assure you, the ability to quickly switch targets will prove valuable in future fights.',27326),
(29626,396,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Wu addresses you sharply.>$b$b$n, is it? The High Elder\'s favored $g son:daughter;? Yes, I remember you from the banquet.$b$bDon\'t expect any special treatment from me, $g boy:young lady;. You\'ll be working just as hard as the greenest pandaren trainee here.$b$bPerhaps harder.',27326),
(29627,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Groundskeeper Wu gratefully scoops up the gathered materials.>$b$bI will have a weapon prepared for you by the end of your training. Now, onto the real work.',27326),
(29628,396,153,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I will see to it that this stew is distributed evenly and appropriately among the trainees.$b$bAfter I set some aside for myself, of course.',27326),
(29629,396,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Do not forget to wash your hands. Blushleaf stains forever.',27326),
(29630,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. The sprites\' numbers will return in several days\' time, but for now, the balance is maintained.',27326),
(29631,2,2,2,2,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. A thousand times, thank you.',27326),
(29632,396,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Master Stone Fist eyes you warily.>$b$bAlright, I\'ve seen enough. No more beating up on the younger pupils. We will proceed to the next phase.',27326),
(29633,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It appears that I must move you up the ranks yet again, $c.',27326),
(29634,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I must warn you, $C:$b$bIf you continue defeating my best trainees, I will no longer be able to train you. And then you will have no excuse to enjoy the presence of my company.$b$bThink wisely before you quickly dispatch any more of my students.$b$b<It is difficult to tell if Master Stone Fist is joking.>',27326),
(29635,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I must admit, I was never surprised, $r. You are a born fighter, and an excellent $c.',27326),
(29636,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Greetings, $n. You are becoming quite famous among the trainees here. I have already heard your name whispered several times, usually between the puffy and discolored lips one of your sparring partners.$b$bI\'m looking forward to working with you.',27326),
(29637,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your $c fighting style is strong, $n. Our trainees could learn much from watching you.',27326),
(29639,396,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Congratulations, $n. While your traineeship was strictly honorary, your results were undeniably impressive. The young ones look up to you.$b$bGroundskeeper Wu had this prepared for you. Please, use it as you see fit.',27326),
(29670,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is extremely unsettling. If mogu are banding together like this all over the continent, it could become a major threat to Pandaria.',27326),
(29690,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n!?$b$bThey told me you were dead...$b$bI\'m glad to see it wasn\'t true. There\'s Alliance to kill!',63305),
(29694,6,274,1,0,0,0,0,0,'These are the only survivors, $n?$b$bSo be it. We will play the hand fate has dealt us.$b$b<Gorrok lifts his head up high.>$b$bNumbers be damned. This is where heroes are made.',63305),
(29716,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh thank you so much for helping find my friends.  I still don\'t see Shin though...',63305),
(29717,2,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wow! You were awesome! You were like *bam* and they were like *aaaaa* and then they were smashed!',63305),
(29723,4,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hurray! Thank you so much! Shin is saved and you beat up the old witch! And the best part is our parents were never told what we were up to. Hurray!$b$bIt looks like everybody who came back are trying to get rid of whatever jade they had. Toya\'s been collecting it for some reason and said you should go chat with him.',63305),
(29725,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So, now you know why ol\' Rell\'s all beat up.$b$b<You detect a change in Sully\'s facial expression, and he quickly turns away. Is he... crying?>',27326),
(29726,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Luckily, we all made it out alive.$b$bWell... all of us except for Socks...',27326),
(29727,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So there you have it. We didn\'t find the White Pawn, but we came back with intel that could be of even greater importance to the Alliance.$b$bThe Horde have allied with the hozen, and are arming them as we speak. They and their monkey army now outnumber us thirty to one.',27326),
(29730,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So, as you can see, none of this is Riko\'s fault.',63305),
(29731,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'And that\'s how we found our Alliance captive.$b$bBut that\'s not all that happened. Not by a long shot...',63305),
(29733,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'...and that\'s <cough> how we found...$b$b<Rell\'s speech devolves into heavy coughing. The corner of his mouth produces a trickle of blood.>',27326),
(29743,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'As you look over your sketch, you can\'t help but hope that these creatures don\'t really exist.',63305),
(29745,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Each statue shatters with a blood-curtling wail as spirits burst free.$B$BThe statues are not merely animate: they are possessed.>',63305),
(29747,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The spirits may yet find peace.>',63305),
(29748,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The statues topple and shatter with ease; a testament to the immense weight of the spirit.>',63305),
(29749,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Allow me to introduce myself: I am Pei-Zhi, Master Spiritsage under the last pandaren emperor Shaohao.$B$BAt least... I was.',63305),
(29750,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $c.$B$BI can already sense the spirits within these bottles - they cry out with fear, confusion... rage.',63305),
(29751,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work. With these, I can complete the ritual to send all of the spirits here--including myself--back where they belong.',63305),
(29752,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. I will take them with me into the nether.',63305),
(29753,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Their bodies had long since returned to the land - their spirits can now follow.',63305),
(29754,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<A simulacrum imbued with the ancient and powerful spirit of Pei-Zhi would make a horrifying weapon for the mogu. Shan Jitong must be stopped!>',63305),
(29755,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This age must be one of great strife to breed heroes such as you. I can only imagine what adventures must lie ahead.$B$BIt has been my great honor to have met you, $p.$B$BI will remain here to usher out the last of the spirits before crossing the tan-chao myself.$B$BStill, I am disturbed by the spirit waker\'s dying curse...$B$B"You will not stop the thunder."$B$BWhat could he have meant?',27326),
(29756,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $p. These mushrooms may not seem like much of an offering, but the sentiment alone will be enough to draw the spirits to us.$B$BAlso, they make a pretty fine stir-fry.',63305),
(29757,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now when the kids ask: "Do you have Bottletoads?" I can say YES!',27356),
(29758,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My MY now look at THIS! What a beautiful shell!$B$BYou were wise to bring this to me, my friend. It will make a fantastic serving platter.$B$BPlease, take this for your troubles.',27356),
(29759,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, with this key I will be able to free our chains.$B$BYou have delivered us from this vile place.',27326),
(29762,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. You do not know how much this means to the families of the lost.',27326),
(29765,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Zin\'Jun sobs...you think.>$b$bDey done killed Snuff...$b$bWhat\'d \'ol Snuff ever do ta dem? ',63305),
(29804,6,15,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Zin\'jun is lost?$b$bThis is a dark day indeed, $gbrother:sister;. These vermin will pay!',63305),
(29815,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, yes, $n. This will do nicely.',63305),
(29821,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This crate should be full of supplies...',63305),
(29822,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome, traveler.$b$bPlease, make yourself comfortable.',63305),
(29823,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yeah, I ran away. So blikkin\' what? If it weren\'t for me, Kiryn would be dead. Oh, wait... she\'s already dead... already...$b$bGo away! Riko\'s head hurts.',63305),
(29824,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The most important thing we learned was that... not only have the Alliance befriended the jinyu, but they\'re giving them weapons, and teaching them how to use them.$b$bThe Alliance now control a force that outnumbers us thirty-to-one. And we - the HORDE - have befriended monkeys.',63305),
(29827,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent! What a creative solution!$b$bThat should hold them off for a while.',63305),
(29865,2,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Such a noble hero. You remind me of a younger, less good looking version of myself.',63305),
(29866,2,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh thank you so much! This is perfect!$b$bI hope it didn\'t stick to you like it stuck to me.$b$bI\'m going to go find Syra and give this to her right away!',63305),
(29871,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Where have I seen you before?',27356),
(29872,5,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, it\'s you!$b$bNo, I haven\'t found the Hidden Master yet. I probably wasted my time coming out here.$b$b<Sigh...>',27366),
(29874,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m pretty sure this settlement wasn\'t here a few weeks ago. Where did these people come from?',27366),
(29877,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks, friend. Now maybe a hozen can get some ookin\' work done around here.',27356),
(29879,6,273,0,0,0,500,0,0,'Wikket save hozen? And bring slickies?$b$bHmm, maybe wikket not so bad.$b$bTooki Tooki never liked Dook Ookem anyway...',63305),
(29881,2,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah! You have a wonderful eye for color my friend.  These will make a superb pigment.',63305),
(29882,2,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My thanks traveler. These will make a fine set of quills. Here is something for your trouble.',63305),
(29883,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It sounds like you made quite the good impression.$B$BWell done, $n!',27326),
(29885,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This should be plenty, $n. Thanks.',27326),
(29887,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You found them? Oh thank the spirits of water!$B$BYou have saved my tailfin, $n.',27326),
(29888,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You look around the empty house.$B$BIt appears you are in the right place, but there is no sign of its inhabitant.',27326),
(29889,6,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I heard your people had washed up on our shores, but I did not expect to find one washed up on my very doorstep! What brings you here, stranger?$b$b<You explain about your search for Prince Anduin, and describe the boy to the pandaren.>$b$bVery interesting! And so the Pearlfin sent you to me, did they?',27326),
(29890,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'How did you find me?$B$B<Anduin listens to you describe the vision from the Dream Brew.>$B$BRemarkable! That\'s exactly what happened several days ago. We\'ve been laying low since then.',27326),
(29891,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is an amazing specimen! I am quite shocked that you have succeeded, actually.',27326),
(29892,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Do you have crocolisks where you are from?',27326),
(29893,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Beautiful color, rare transparency, shimmer but not sparkle...these will do quite well.$B$BI am beginning to see great potential in you, strange one.',27326),
(29894,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I saw the vision, $n. What do you think it means?$B$BI think it is clear that you play some part in it.',27326),
(29898,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The healing waters should abate Ren\'s fever for a short while, but alas, I fear it is no permanent cure.$B$BThank you, $c. We have granted him a little more time, at least.',27326),
(29899,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you... friend. I am... happy... knowing... the spirits... are at peace.',27326),
(29900,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh... it is the poem! Did you... read it? What did you learn about the Vale?',27326),
(29901,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'He did WHAT?!?!?$B$BHe\'s lucky that I haven\'t found him yet, because when I do, I just might kill him myself!$B$BWhatever he thinks he\'s doing... chasing after this Vale... it is not behavior fit for a prince!$B$BIf we didn\'t have more pressing matters at hand, I would send our entire fleet chasing after his heels!',27326),
(29903,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good. Let those Horde mongrels show their faces now!',27326),
(29904,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your trainees returned recently. I could hardly believe my eyes! They did not look like the same jinyu that you left with.$B$BExcellent work, $c. Couldn\'t have done better myself.',27326),
(29905,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The waters were right about you, $n. Because of your efforts, this village has a future. We will not forget the lessons you\'ve taught us, $c.',27326),
(29906,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Without their leader, these hozen should once again settle into disarray.$B$BToday we rejoice in our victory! $n, you came to us a stranger, but you depart as a friend.$B$BFrom henceforth, you are the highest of the high - a valued friend and defender of the Pearlfin tribe.',27326),
(29907,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome, welcome, visitors! You\'ve come to sample some of my son\'s turnips? Perhaps purchase a few pigs?$b$bPlease, make yourselves at home. I have plenty of room.',27356),
(29908,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Pang surveys the area around his farm.>$b$bWell, they\'re not ALL gone yet, but there\'s less of them. And they aren\'t holding their ears quite as high anymore.$b$bI\'d guess that they\'re scared of you, $n.',27356),
(29909,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wha-? Who the...? My father sent you?$b$bPshh... he can be so nosy sometimes. I have everything under control here.',27356),
(29910,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $gsir:ma\'am;! Now I can get back to my chores.',27356),
(29911,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ho ho! Now that\'s what I like to see!',27356),
(29912,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I understand you\'re the one who sent the food down from uncle\'s farm. Thank you.$b$bMy pigs are picky eaters, but those turnips and watermelons are some of their favorites.',27356),
(29913,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Liang sorts through the meat.>$b$bYou\'re not just a $c, but you\'re a butcher, too? You\'ve got an eye for quality pig food, neighbor.$b$b<Liang throws the meat into the muddy pit below.>',27356),
(29914,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There they are! Back into the sty with you three, now!$b$b<Liang looks up at you.>$b$bThank you, neighbor. I\'m truly grateful for your assistance.',27356),
(29915,274,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You really shouldn\'t have brought the lamb back to me. He... he was safer in that pigsty than he is over here.',27356),
(29916,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They... they\'re not stopping, but at least we fought back. Right?',27356),
(29917,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I know I should be the one fighting them off. Maybe I\'m not cut out for shepherding after all.',27356),
(29918,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Francis has taken longer than I expected to become an effective shepherd. We all go through these phases... my son Liang was weak once, too. As was I.$b$bBut he will learn. It is the Thunderfoot way.',27356),
(29919,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'If yer lookin\' fer beer, you came to the right place, neighbor.$b$bJust, ah... excuse the mess. Had me a bit of a problem with virmen the last few days.',27356),
(29920,4,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They... they agreed?! Fantastic! Thank you so much! With their blessing we can be the happiest pandaren in all the land!$b$bPlease, take this. We meant it to be a tribute for the pandriarchs but they didn\'t seem interested.',63305),
(29922,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your deeds have sparked a long forgotten memory I have of an ancient prophecy. This deserves investigation.$b$bIn order to investigate, I need jade though. I have instructed Toya to gather as much as he can find and give it to you when he is done. Bring it to me and we will see about deciphering the ancient "Emperor\'s Omen."$b$bWhile he gathers the jade, feel free to explore. You may find the people of this town are in need of a person of your caliber. ',27326),
(29924,4,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The dreaded Kher Shan is dead. You have avenged  Ick Ick, Nab Nab, Eet Eet, Bitty Bitty, and the others that Nibi Nibi couldn\'t remember.',63305),
(29925,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I knew Toya would come through for me!$B$BHe can get anything, you know.',63305),
(29926,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well I\'ll be... you actually did it!$B$BYou lookin\' for a more permanent job, $gbuddy:sister;? I could use a bruiser like you around full-time!',27326),
(29927,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Hao looks up at you, struggling to pull himself from the rubble.>$B$BNo, no. I got it. HNNGHHH!!$B$BOkay, maybe I don\'t got it.',27326),
(29928,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Catch? They were playin\' CATCH with my product?!$B$BI hope you showed those walkin\' toothpicks a thing or two.$B$BYou know, maybe you ain\'t a $gcub:tart; after all. I\'ve been lookin\' for some muscle to help out with my problem at the quarry.$B$BAnd judgin\' by the size of the Lorewalker\'s restoration project here, I think you\'ll need a lot more jade.',63305),
(29929,11,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Hao lets out a hearty laugh.>$B$BI seen \'em come runnin\' out o\' there like ol\' Kher Shan himself were givin\' chase.',27326),
(29930,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did it! You brought my honey-bear back!$B$BOh thank you, $p! Thank you!',27326),
(29931,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Am I seeing this right? A whole shipment of pure, high quality uncut jade?$B$BThank goodness. I knew Foreman Mann would come through for us.$B$BOh and you too. Thanks for bringing it by.',27326),
(29932,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You bring news from the Serpent\'s Heart?$B$B<The Elder Sage patiently listens to your tale of what occurred at the Jade Mines and at the large jade statue.>$B$BThank you for coming all this way, stranger. However, I cannot allow you to speak to the Jade Serpent right now.$B$BThe ancient one is very busy, and as you can see, is not here at the moment.',27326),
(29933,4,1,94,0,0,500,0,0,'Woot! Woot! Wikket da Ook Dook!',63305),
(29935,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hmm.$b$bMean wikkets fighting with nice wikkets?$b$bHozen fight mean wikkets too!',63305),
(29936,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Impressive work, $n.$b$bIt had not occurred to me that we might somehow befriend these creatures.$b$bWith their acceptance, we can now turn our attention to more important matters.',63305),
(29937,11,1,94,0,0,0,0,0,'Yeah!$b$bNow that\'s the stuff. Just you wait and see...',63305),
(29939,479,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We\'ve just revolutionized how these cretins.. err, hozen, feed themselves.$b$bThey\'ll never be the same!',63305),
(29940,1,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Perfect.$b$b<Ang surveys the bruised turnips and the soggy watermelons.>$b$bWhat were they DOING down there!?',27356),
(29941,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work $n.$b$bThe away team you assembled has departed.$b$bI hope Gorrok had the sense to change out of that ragged red shirt. I admire his patriotism, but he\'s had it on since we left Orgrimmar.$b$bThey won\'t be surprising anyone if he\'s wearing it...',63305),
(29942,4,1,66,0,0,0,0,0,'Now everybody got grub! Great hozen wisdom in Eekle Eekle.$b$bMaybe Eekle Eekle become Chieftain someday...',63305),
(29943,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes!$b$bBy Thrall\'s bloodied fist, I\'ve missed hunting Alliance!',63305),
(29944,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Chen nods.>$b$bGood work, $n. You\'re not bad in combat.$b$bWhat do you say we team up for the next part?',27356),
(29945,5,11,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Whoah, whoah, WHOAH! You brought back BLOOD? I guess I should have looked around for a half second before I asked you to bring me something red.$b$bYeesh!$b$b<Li Li turns back to the ingredients, spends a moment crushing the flower petals, and then mixes in some of the blood.>$b$b<She begins to giggle.>',27356),
(29946,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That should take care of the virmen for a few weeks, at least. Enough time for Mudmug to get out a few good batches of beer, uninterrupted.$b$bAnd isn\'t that what\'s really important?',27356),
(29947,11,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Bah ha hah haaaa! I love messing with virmen.',27356),
(29948,1,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Aww, thank ya kindly, $gsir:ma\'am;. You\'re a real $ggentleman:sweetheart;.',27356),
(29949,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I know Uncle Chen\'s coming back. I\'m not worried.$b$bActually, this is probably my big chance to finally explore Pandaria! No fat uncle tying me down!',27356),
(29950,5,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That was great! You and I should go exploring again sometime.$b$bAnd it looks like we finished before Uncle Chen got back, too. Perfect.',27356),
(29951,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You done good, $n. You done good.',27356),
(29952,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Maybe I wasn\'t meant to settle down anyhow.',27356),
(29966,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Alliance must be purged from this land, $n!$b$bNo half-measures will do!',63305),
(29967,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'d say repelling the attack is an understatement!',63305),
(29968,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, the smell of progress, and methane. ',63305),
(29971,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We may have a problem.',63305),
(29981,1,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lin asked you to help us out? Rather presumptive of her.$b$bStill, we are short-manned. We won\'t turn down your help... or the girl\'s. You have our thanks, $c.',27366),
(29982,274,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A few stubborn ranchers want to make my job harder?$b$b<The Watch Commander sighs.>$b$bFine. I will rob no pandaren of his right to defend his land.',27366),
(29983,6,273,0,0,0,3000,0,0,'You seek training?$b$b<The pandaren studies your physique for several seconds, without speaking.>$b$bAlright.',27366),
(29984,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You show promise, $n. We will continue.$b$bIt is now time for your first round of training.',27366),
(29985,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You follow directions well, $n.',27366),
(29986,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You honor your people, $n.',27366),
(29987,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have the gift of focus, $n. Not many of my students make it this far.$b$b<Master Bruised Paw glances over at Lin.>',27366),
(29988,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now you know why I don\'t gather the eggs myself.$b$bShall we continue your training?',27366),
(29989,2,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Master Bruised Paw bows before you.>$b$bStone quivers and breaks beneath your fists. You have the power to move mountains, if you so desire.$b$bThere is nothing more I can teach you.',27366),
(29990,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m glad to hear that Lin is well.$b$bOur defenses are holding, for now. The mantid continue to send their scouts over the wall, but they haven\'t gotten much farther than that.',27366),
(29992,432,432,4,0,0,0,0,0,'<Lin pauses for a moment to rub the leaves on her swollen paws.>$b$bThank you! I can prepare a proper ointment later, but this will do for now.',27366),
(29993,2,1,1,0,0,500,500,0,'You seek two lovers blind to the ambitions of their family names. They were here, seeking a way to hold to their path.$b$bSadly they did not find their answers among the trees or art.',63305),
(29995,2,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh stranger! Please tell me you can help us. They really hurt my Lo.',63305),
(29997,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am but an old jinyu, and those pesky water sprites were impossible to catch. Thank you, $n, for returning my staff to me.',27326),
(29998,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Elder Sage Rain-Zhu sent you?$B$BVery well. You shall help me.',27326),
(29999,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You found them and brought them all back!$B$BThey\'ve really taken a liking to you.$B$BThank you so much!',27326),
(30000,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Did you deliver your message?',27326),
(30001,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, yes, thank you! You\'ve thinned out their numbers wonderfully.',27326),
(30002,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, wonderful! I am so relieved that we managed to avert disaster.$B$BNo no, don\'t get too close, please. You still have some squashed bug bits on your shoes.',27326),
(30004,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lorewalker Stonestep is back to work?$B$BRemarkable. You were able to do what the last four priests I sent could not.$B$BI...I think my headache is disappearing.',27326),
(30005,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yay! I saw the fireworks all the way from over here!$B$BThank you so much, $n.',27326),
(30011,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wonderful! Knowing that the scryer has returned to his meditations has lifted a great burden from my shoulders.',27326),
(30015,1,404,1,0,0,500,500,0,'Greetings, $n!$b$bWelcome to Dawn\'s Blossom, a home of my people.$b$bSadly I must depart. Alas, a Lorewalker\'s work is never done.$b$bMake yourself at home. Our people could surely make use of one with your talents.',63305),
(30028,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Why thank you very much stranger. This has not been a good day, but you certainly have helped us make it better.$b$bPlease, take this, you\'ve earned it. ',27356),
(30029,2,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for your help stranger! Hopefully we can deal with the rest on our own from here.',27356),
(30030,2,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now that that\'s over I have some ideas on how to make a new concoction. We\'ll see.$b$bThank you for your help. Here is your reward.',27356),
(30031,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Huh. I guess none of that grain is going to work. Uncle Chen is pretty picky.$b$bMaybe the Grainlord knows where we can find something more... special.',27356),
(30032,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now THIS smells like the right stuff!',27356),
(30046,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let\'s make some beer.',27356),
(30047,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah! Now these are some beautifully malted grains. The two of you have a good eye and nose.',27356),
(30048,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n? What are you doing here?$b$bSo, Uncle Chen wants sweet malts? No problem! Let\'s get to the taste testing.',27356),
(30049,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n! You here to help out? That\'s mighty swell of you.',27356),
(30050,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hmmph!$b$bNice farming.',27356),
(30051,1,11,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lookee that, neighbor! That is quite the collection of water we got here. With magical water like this, I\'m sure that Chen\'ll make a brew that really shines.$b$bOr possibly a brew that lands someone in the outhouse for a month. I guess we\'ll just have to wait and see.',27356),
(30052,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You weed like a champion.',27356),
(30053,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'After talking with the farmers, it seems like they all will be willing to part with some hops... provided that you help them out some way in return.',27356),
(30054,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So many teeth! Maybe Mung-Mung will glue them together to make a tiny rake.',27356),
(30055,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Look at all these hops! This is quality stuff, too.$b$bWe\'re making headway, $n. Soon we\'ll have all the ingredients to finally start brewing.',27356),
(30056,274,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,'No... no... get back... I don\'t want...$b$bWait, you\'re not a carrot. You\'re not a virmen either. You\'re here to save me?',27356),
(30057,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What\'s all this fuss about carrots? I don\'t get it.',27356),
(30058,2,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We are pursuing perfection in our art and in ourselves. Along the way many mistakes will be made.$b$bI\'m sure by tomorrow this field will be swimming with more mistakes. Still, we thank you for your help.',27356),
(30059,2,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It seems like there\'s not QUITE as many corrupted moths out there. At the very least, you\'ve bought me some more time before I get in big, big trouble.',27356),
(30069,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great work! If you ever decide to give up your life of adventure, the SI:7 could use more talent like you...',27326),
(30070,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sha...$b$bFighting the Horde on a foreign shore is hard enough.',27326),
(30072,2,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Superb specimens. I will see to it they find their way to the right place. Please enjoy this free sample.',27356),
(30073,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks for waiting so long. You are as patient as you are brave.',27366),
(30074,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The door... it\'s boarded up?',27366),
(30075,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ve had just about enough of this brewery. I\'m starting to think that you and I should just bust down the wall and clean house.',27366),
(30076,1,1,273,0,0,0,0,0,'Looks like plain ol\' water to me. It\'s hard to believe it\'s actually the corpse of a real, honest-to-goodness walkin\'-around living thing.$b$bCan\'t wait to turn it into beer and drink it.',27366),
(30077,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What is it with monkeys and barrels, anyway?',27366),
(30078,25,1,11,0,0,0,0,0,'Take a look around - it\'s a lot calmer outside. All the brewery needed was somebody strong to take care of it.$b$bIt\'s going to take some time to clean this place up, but I don\'t really mind that so much.$b$bThis is, after all... my home.',27366),
(30079,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Only one lady-panda who\'s not crazy? This worse than Ken-Ken thought...',27366),
(30080,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let me guess: my aunt sent you?',27366),
(30081,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Pandaren got a case of the spooky-dooks!$B$BDooks get scared sometimes, don\'t wanna come out. Poor, fluffy mopey-dopes must be ready to explode by now!$B$BThis just the thing to bring \'em out. That make pandaren happy for sure!$B$BJust like ol\' gramma used to say: can\'t THROW if can\'t GO!',27366),
(30082,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I can\'t believe he was actually going to do that... This despair is worse than I had even imagined.$B$BI cannot thank you enough for bringing him back.',27366),
(30083,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. That should teach those savages to know their boundaries.',27366),
(30084,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n.$B$BZhu Province serves as a corridor from the upper tier of the valley down to the sea.$B$BKeeping the province safe requires daily efforts to maintain a border against the savage Krasarang Wilds.',27366),
(30086,396,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Were you listening in? Don\'t worry, I don\'t mind. You\'re welcome to search for the hidden master as well.$b$bThough, if you do find him, I\'d appreciate if you came back here and told me where he was.',27356),
(30088,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Just in time! All done... look!$B$B<Ken-Ken holds up a carved wooden mask with a ridiculous face.>$B$BNow we put on finishing touches and we gots a guaranteed FUN MACHINE!',27366),
(30089,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We saving pandaren, but the land still sad... Look, rain\'s not stopping at all!$B$B<Ken-Ken shakes his tiny fists at the sky.>$B$BHow many more butts we gotta punch before we fix this town?!$B$B<The sky darkens in response.>',27366),
(30090,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We did some good work here today, $p.$B$BMonastery always tell us to leave a place better than we find it.',27366),
(30091,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $c.$B$BIt\'s time we take back our land from this curse.',27366),
(30117,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Finally! Emmi\'s come through.$b$bI hope all is well at the Stormstout Brewery. My men don\'t do well without beer.',27366),
(30134,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank goodness, they finally sent someone!$B$BThings have gotten out of control!',27326),
(30135,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $r.$B$BI tried to stop the Slitherscale where I could, but I was no match for their numbers.$B$BYour work today will help preserve an entire generation of cloud serpents.',27326),
(30136,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t worry. The hatchlings will be safe inside their nests.$B$BI can\'t thank you enough for arriving when you did.',27326),
(30137,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, wonderful!$B$BThese eggs look...well...they look a little on the small side. Are you sure you couldn\'t find any better ones?$B$BOh well, I suppose with the current situation, we can\'t be so picky.',27326),
(30138,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You may choose only one egg to take with you.$B$BChoose carefully. There is no going back.',27326),
(30140,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah yes, Elder Anli mentioned that a new student had joined our ranks. I see you have already chosen your cloud serpent egg.$B$BI will instruct you on its care. Let me see it for a moment.',27326),
(30142,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Congratulations! It\'s a beautiful hatchling of your own.$B$BPlease take care of it, $n.',27326),
(30168,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Not many would stop to help a village in need... especially so deep in the wilds.$b$bYou are a champion to our people, $p.',27366),
(30169,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have done us a great service today. On behalf of my people I thank you.$b$bPlease, accept this token of our gratitude.',27366),
(30172,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good! The water\'s here!',27356),
(30178,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see... And the sha have seeped out as far as the province already, have they?$B$BWell, I hate to break it to you, but the temple is also overrun with sha. Those of us who haven\'t been killed or... possessed, or whatever, are fleeing for our very lives.$B$BIf you defeated the sha at Zhu\'s Watch, I have to implore you to help us deal with them here.\n',27366),
(30181,21,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done $p.$b$bMy father travels across the sea to a new continent and all he can seem ta\' want to hunt is old borin\' wolves.$b$bMe, I like to hunt stuff with meat on its bones.',27366),
(30182,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done! You outfoxed the foxes. I will talk to Mr. Pleeb about getting you another trophy made.',27366),
(30183,21,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wow! You really racked up a count. I\'ll chat with Mr. Pleeb about getting the best one converted to a trophy for you.',27366),
(30184,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now that\'s a proper trophy right there.',27366),
(30185,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank ye. This one aught ta\' one up me pop.',27366),
(30186,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You saved me son! I canno\' ever thank ye enough. Please! Take this fer your efforts. ',27366),
(30252,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What? You cleared the rocks? That\'s great news!$B$BMaybe now I can actually start growing something on this farm!',27356),
(30254,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nicely done.$B$BNotice how those seeds sprouted immediately? That\'s part of what makes this valley so ideal for farming - something about the soil here just makes veggies grow like crazy!$B$BThe work\'s not done yet, though.',27356),
(30255,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great, the cabbages are tended and looking good!$B$BToday they were thirsty, but you never know what they might need. Pay close attention to your crops and tend them accordingly.$B$BI got all kinds of advice from my grandpa, so if you\'re ever unsure of how to take care of something, feel free to ask!$B$BJust make sure it\'s strictly related to farming...',27356),
(30256,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, those are the basics!$B$BTill the soil, plant the seeds, tend to any threats, then wait for the results!$B$BToday was easy, but stay on your toes: my grandfather told me all kinds of crazy stories about farming at Sunsong Ranch.$B$BFarming ain\'t all giant turnips and roses, you know.',27356),
(30257,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh my, a marsh lily!$B$BHow did you know that these are my favorite? I just might take a liking to you, stranger.$B$BThank you!',27356),
(30261,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'When they built the wall, I don\'t think they knew we\'d be using it for this.',18414),
(30267,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Finally, someone who understands me. Fishing is what it\'s all about, right?$b$bMaybe I should leave New Cifera... just pack up my things and join the Anglers, down in the south. Of course, I couldn\'t leave my family behind...$b$bBut still... a pandaren can dream, right?',27356),
(30268,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $c. I knew you\'d be hardy enough to handle it.$B$BJudging by the sounds coming out of these refugees, I would not wish the murksweats on my worst enemy.',27366),
(30269,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $p. We would not have made it without your help.',27366),
(30270,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done. I only wish I could have accompanied you...$B$BThe blood on these hand-wraps is not my own, you know.',27366),
(30271,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Honestly, I\'m a little surprised that worked.$B$BPandaria is proving to be a land where the lines between metaphor and reality are blurred.',27366),
(30272,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You know something, $p? We make a pretty good team!',27366),
(30273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have vanquished the Sha of Despair. My order can handle the remaining cleanup from here.$B$BIt seems the time has finally come to face the consequences of Shaohao\'s actions.$B$BThis conflict has been a long time coming - the arrival of your people was merely a catalyst. Now, your help will be necessary if Pandaria is to survive.',27366),
(30274,2,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fabulous! Your timing was impeccable. Another day in there and I think we would have wasted away to nothing.$b$bNow we can continue our search for the Pools of Youth!',27366),
(30344,2,378,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh! Fabulous! Fabulous!$b$BYour one trip has advanced my research more than ten years of reading dusty tomes and decaying scrolls...$b$bAnd those "mogu" you saw. I have been doing some research as well as speaking to Kang on the subject.$b$bI suspect now that they were the race of the lost dynasties that my research is derived from.$b$bOf course, that also means that they are the ones who used to control the Pools of Youth.',27366),
(30346,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $p. Hmm, it looks like the mogu are here to collect ancient relics and weapons from their forgotten dynasty. That is a problem we can face later though.$b$bAh! Here is a reference to the Pools of Youth.',27366),
(30347,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You... you found the pools! The waters do exist!$b$bSomething is wrong though. I feel equal parts shadow and light swirling in this vial.',27366),
(30348,25,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wha... what happened? The water... it... it only transfers life. It will not make new life.',27366),
(30349,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $p. Another few missions like that and we might have to make you an honorary sentinel.',27366),
(30350,11,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ha! With this I can make a stew potent enough to knock these waifish elves on their feet.',27366),
(30351,1,11,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s it! You pick, I punch!',27366),
(30352,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fantastic. Only thing that would make this hunting trip more entertaining is a chair. Here is the reward I promised you.',27366),
(30353,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great! This stuff is gonna make me a mint back in Kalimdor. Here\'s your cut.',27366),
(30354,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There are so few of us, it is a great relief to see such help.',27366),
(30355,66,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done $p. You have removed the sword from the child\'s hands.',27366),
(30356,66,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have bought us some much needed breathing room to lick our wounds and prepare a counter-attack.',27366),
(30357,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It has been a long time since I rolled up my sleeves and helped the needy. In my lust for immortality I forgot why I became a priest.$b$bThank you for reminding me there is good in this world worth fighting for, $p.',27366),
(30359,66,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for avenging my daughter. I am not willing to let her stay dead however.$b$bI still have the waters of youth.',27366),
(30360,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Mantid from the south? This is not a good day.',27366),
(30361,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for your help, $c! I\'ve never seen anybody stand up to the mantid like that before.$b$bWell, other than the Shado-Pan, of course...',27366),
(30363,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$p, well timed as usual. It turns out the mogu know how to use portals as well.',27366),
(30384,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sunwalkers are not to be trusted. They are the most militant branch of the tauren armies within the horde.$b$BThank you for your help in this, $p. Please accept this token as a reward.',27366),
(30445,18,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'He... he shouldn\'t have done that! He shouldn\'t have paid for my mistake!',27366),
(30457,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We are delivered! I was right about you, $c.',63305),
(30459,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. You\'ve saved our defensive line here.$B$BThis next attack wouldn\'t have been possible without you.',63305),
(30460,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have my thanks, $n. You have shown great honor through your actions.$B$BI hope that my family\'s dit da jow was of some use to you.',63305),
(30467,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So horrible... When I saw the killing, I just ran. My father, Mei... are they alive?',63305),
(30468,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is satisfying to hear that our enemies are dead. Perhaps you can use one of my bodyguard\'s weapons.',63305),
(30469,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you... we will eat now, at least.',63305),
(30480,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see now that this ritual rips whatever was controlling the minds of these creatures from them. I now know what we must do.',63305),
(30487,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve arrived just in time, $c! I was starting to think I would die up here!',27377),
(30488,273,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for the save, stranger!',27377),
(30489,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You just earned me a handsome bonus. Getting those needles is a pain in the paw but worth it when we take our yaks to market. Here, for your troubles.',27377),
(30491,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, stranger! Hopefully we\'ll be able to cash these in and recoup some of the damages the yaungol inflicted.',27377),
(30492,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah! I can smell the luck from here. The Muskpaws always have good yaks for sale.',27377),
(30495,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What, done already? You\'re quite the runner, $c. You ever thought about making a living out of this?',27326),
(30496,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good. Now we have some hope of redeeming this situation.',63305),
(30498,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome back, $n. I trust your journey has been insightful, particularly in regards to the layout of the land. There is still much to do before we march into battle. ',27326),
(30500,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is terrible...$b$bWe must find a way to undo what has been done here.',27326),
(30502,18,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Cho looks at you despondently.>$b$bThis jade was meant for... so much more.',27326),
(30508,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, is that you? I can\'t believe we survived the destruction of the Jade Serpent.$B$BSome of us anyway.',27377),
(30510,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Where have you been, $n? Nevermind. As you can see, we survived the battle at the Jade Serpent.$B$BUnfortunately, so did... they.',63305),
(30512,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well... we are alive, and that is better than we could have hoped for without your help.\n\nBut, if this is truly to become a base of operations for you, and if we are to join your Alliance, there is one more thing you must do to guarantee our security.',27377),
(30513,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well... we are alive, and that is better than we could have hoped for without your help.\n\nBut, if this is truly to become a base of operations for you, and if we are to join your Horde, there is one more thing you must do to guarantee our security.',63305),
(30514,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did it! At the very least, we have justice, and safety, though in the process we have lost so much.\n\nRegardless, it has been decided. We will join the Alliance, and with your help, rebuild this village.',27377),
(30515,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did it! At the very least, we have justice, and safety, though in the process we have lost so much.\n\nRegardless, it has been decided. We will join the Horde, and with your help, rebuild this village.',63305),
(30526,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The dog perks its ears up at the sight of the juicy steak.$B$BAs soon as you throw it down, the dog starts eating ravenously.',19243),
(30535,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'He waved at me! And he gave you the first pack of seeds for free?$B$BWell, what a nice guy!$B$BYou\'re doing a great job so far. Here\'s a little... seed money. Hah!',27356),
(30565,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well these aren\'t as good as she deserves, but it will have to work.$b$b<Sully pats the dismantled ballista.>$b$bI\'ll get \'er up and runnin\' in no time, just ye watch!',27326),
(30568,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Impressive work, $n. We should be ready to move out shortly. With our allies at our side, there is no way we can be defeated. ',27326),
(30569,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re a sight for sore eyes, $c.$B$BI\'ll be glad to help you Alliance fellas out. First though, you need to help me get my farm back.',27377),
(30571,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now ain\'t you just the thing?$B$BThough, I guess it\'s not fair to force these here workers to stay with us, now that we don\'t have much work for \'em...',27377),
(30575,1,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These yaks will do the trick nicely. Good work, $p. I\'m feeling better about this whole situation already.',27377),
(30581,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well there you go. We should be plenty good, now.',27377),
(30582,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ya never know how much you can lose until you\'ve lost it. My wife passed a few seasons ago, but I can tell you this is a day when I could use her smile the most.$b$bAt least she doesn\'t have to see what these yaungol did to her beloved ranch.',27377),
(30583,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work! I\'m telliin\' ye, these Kun-Lai meaty bits are grade A goodness!',27377),
(30587,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well then, I am mighty grateful for you culling some of those yaungols for us.$b$bHopefully your little display of authority will be enough to discourage them from coming over here.',27377),
(30592,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Many thanks and fortune to you, friend of grummles. But the journey to the Serpent\'s Spine is not safe yet.',27377),
(30593,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Alright! Looks like we won\'t have a bunch of statues to worry about any more. Good work, $p!',27377),
(30595,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wow! I mean, wow! Thank you, $n!$B$B<Bao Jian\'s eyes widen with anticipation of the proceeds from the relics.>$B$BNow that you\'ve softened them up, I\'m thinking that I might head in. Just a few more relics from around the outskirts. Nothing dangerous.',27377),
(30599,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A confident hozen is a dangerous hozen.$b$bThank you for your help, friend of grummles.',27377),
(30600,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are good fortune for grummles.$b$bWhen we are back at a proper camp I must buy you the smelliest, luckiest incense I can find.',27377),
(30601,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Incense works like a charm! Effects will not last long, so you must hurry!',27377),
(30602,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Look what Broketooths and Knucklethumps did to grummle waystation. Hardly a luckydo to be found.$b$bGrummles had a deal with the hozen. We give them food, and they don\'t ravage. Whenever they think to ravage, Shado-Pan remind them not to ravage.$b$bBut all of Shado-Pan are away defending the wall now. And the hozen want more food than the grummles have.',27377),
(30603,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My luckydo! Oh happy day of good fortune! Many thanks!',27377),
(30604,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $p! Hopefully that will slow the Broketooth ravage.',27377),
(30605,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good fortune for me to be saved by a luckydo like you.$b$bAnd Brother Rabbitsfoot always say I not have good fortune. Bah!',27377),
(30606,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are a true luckydo.',27377),
(30607,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh wow that looked like one wild ride!',27377),
(30608,4,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Today is a day of many good and bad fortunes. Bad fortune that hozen stole my grummles. Good fortune that my $r saves my grummles. Bad fortune that so many hozen must die to learn lesson. Good fortune that $rs are luckydos and know how to fight.$b$bGrummles are not fighters. We carry, we explore, and we are content.',27377),
(30610,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now that hozen king is going to learn why it is bad fortune to cheat grummles.',27377),
(30611,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ready for the yeti?',27377),
(30612,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Ook of Dook is dead! Hurray!',27377),
(30614,15,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Happy day! Your reward. May these coins bring you good fortune.',27377),
(30616,4,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is good fortune that a $r comes to help grummles. Good fortune to friend of grummles.',27377),
(30617,273,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to One Keg! Gateway to Burlap Trail and Mount Neverest.',27377),
(30618,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh thank you, $n! If I just cut off the nibbled pieces and repair the minor damage, I may still be able to sell these.$b$bOnce your cart is ready to go I\'ll have the supplies I promised loaded up!',27377),
(30619,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, thank goodness! You\'ve saved all of our skins, believe me.\n\nYou have no idea how much trouble those guys can stir up.\n\nErr, or, I guess you do, now. Kind of. Almost.\n\nImagine that, but a lot worse, and for a couple thousand years.',27377),
(30621,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you! It appears my trinkets were lucky for you too, $c. While you were gone I did not gamble and lose my cart.$b$bI would be happy to lend it to you for your journey. Besides, I have some goods to win back from this shady grummle!',27377),
(30622,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My wall... I spent my life atop that wall...',27366),
(30623,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It looks like the mantid are definitely under the sway of the sha... the sha of fear.$b$bPerhaps they\'re not attacking after all - perhaps they are running away from something. What could possibly be on the other side of that wall?',27366),
(30624,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nothing makes a pandaren happier than an untapped keg. Chen\'s beer may not have improved anyone\'s fighting skills today, but it certainly improved their morale.',27366),
(30625,1,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They can\'t keep fighting like this forever. Those kids are downright heroic, but I don\'t want them to die as heroes.$b$bIt\'s time to throw in the towel.',27366),
(30626,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see.$b$bWell, we gave it our all. It\'s time to evacuate, save lives, and reassess our strategy, before these mantid take over the entire valley.',27366),
(30627,1,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I can\'t believe it! You - a foreign-born $r - have succeeded where the Shado-Pan have failed. You\'ve succeeded where the WALL has failed.$b$bWe may hold this farming village after all.',27366),
(30628,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Peering inside, you find...',27366),
(30648,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Be wise, traveler.$b$bProve to these inhabitants that there is more to your people than war and destruction.',27377),
(30650,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, if it isn\'t our hero, $n.\n\nI really wasn\'t sure we stood a fighting chance out here, you know?\n\nThese guys may be a little rough around the edges, but we\'ll be able to whip \'em into shape. And when we do, we\'ll have a real fighting chance at holding our own here in Kun-Lai.\n\nGood work.',27377),
(30651,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ho ho, that were a fine sight to see. I knew I should have gone up there with ya, $n!',27377),
(30652,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The Ordo lieutenants are dead. The shield is down.>$B$B<Time to take out the Ordo leader!>',27377),
(30660,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve done it, $n! I\'m in your debt!$B$BAgain!',27377),
(30665,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have bought us some time to breathe. We must not despair - instead, we must act.',27377),
(30666,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yesterday, we were fishing happily. Today, the crocs just started... tryin\' to eat us.$b$bStrange.',27366),
(30667,4,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks, $n. You\'ve made my day. I always hate to see such a prime feather-gathering opportunity go to waste.',27366),
(30668,432,432,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Jay deftly weaves the planks together into a surprisingly seaworthy-looking vessel, then tosses them down into water below.>',27366),
(30669,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You appear troubled, child.$b$bHow can this Lorewalker serve you? What is it that you seek?',27366),
(30670,1,0,0,0,1000,0,0,0,'Good. Now you will see how to defeat unbridled rage.\n\nI will craft these into a trap for Kobai, the leader of the yaungol. Though he will be snared, and we will defeat him, he is not our ultimate target...',27377),
(30671,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve brought me more meat than I could ever hope to eat.$b$bNow, I suppose I owe you a story...',27366),
(30672,1,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Jay listens to your account of the day\'s events.>$b$bI see. We\'ll keep an eye on the Ungas from here. And we\'ll do our best not to fish these waters too heavily, either. No doubt we\'re part of the problem, too.$b$bUntil next time, $n.',27366),
(30674,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The grateful fish swim happily toward the safety of the middle of the lagoon.$b$bWith any luck, they will be eaten by crocolisks.',27366),
(30675,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With some effort, the box creaks open. This must be what the hozen were hiding...',27366),
(30682,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We didn\'t know that there were any survivors out there.$B$BThank you for bringing them to safety, $n.',27377),
(30683,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You were attacked by a mogu? That sounds terrible!$b$bI hate to ask, but did you manage to pick up any supplies while you were fighting for your life?$b$bNo?! This is very bad luck.',27377),
(30684,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you made it, and you honored the shrines.$B$BI knew you could handle it.',27377),
(30690,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I should feel shame at the loss of the village. I should feel great pride in your success. \n\nI should feel many things, but must not allow myself to. Until our struggle with the sha is complete, we must maintain total control of our emotions.',27377),
(30691,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nahassa\'s fevered suffering has come to an end.',27366),
(30692,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ha ha! Hero of grummles! Welcome to Kota Basecamp. Enjoy good fortune for most happy grummle delivery.',27377),
(30694,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Every trap you sprang is a life saved, be it pandaren, beast, or otherwise. Nobody deserves an honorless death like that.',27366),
(30695,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Koro\'s metaphors can get a little tiring, but there\'s always true wisdom behind them.',27366),
(30699,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Shado-Master Chong sent you, hmm?\n\nYes, we received his request for reinforcements.\n\nWe are in no position to grant it, however. We\'ve just concluded a battle of our own, and the monastery\'s been locked up tight. \n\nWe can\'t even get reinforcements here, and we\'re just down the hill!',27377),
(30715,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good. I will see to it that the armor is returned to their pupils.',27377),
(30723,71,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good. After what they have done, I would not show the Yaungol kindness in life. But neither will I allow their bodies to be eaten by the birds.',27377),
(30724,5,2,0,0,0,2000,0,0,'Wow, that was quite a bit of kite-flying there. Good job getting up here and not dying.\n\nIt\'s good you\'re here, too. Lao-chen\'s got an idea he\'s working on, but in the meantime we\'ve got yaungol to deal with.',27377),
(30742,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, friend. Let this be a lesson to you: never feed the goots.',27377),
(30743,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great, I\'ll get up there and... harvest them soon.$B$B<Cousin Gootfur begins wrapping long strips of linen around his hands.>$B$BCan\'t believe I thought this was a good idea.',27377),
(30744,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<As you bundle the berries together, you hear a mighty roar echo across the mountain, followed by the squeal of a terrified grummle.>',27377),
(30745,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You made it!$B$BYeti\'s are tough enough on their own - can\'t imagine what a cranky kafa-addict yeti must be like. You brave. Or lucky. Or dumb.$B$BMaybe all three.',27377),
(30746,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You brought kafa?!$B$BYou...$B$BMagnificent...$B$BLuckydo...$B$BHurry, let\'s give it to her! Maybe she won\'t have us both for snack...',27377),
(30747,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wow! That was VIOLENT.$B$BNot sure what I was expecting...$B$BThanks to you, I think we may have just formed a mutually beneficial relationship with the Terror of Kota Peak.',27377),
(30750,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ha! I could see them flying. Good work.',27377),
(30751,25,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Alright. I am off to prepare our next move. Good luck, friend.',27377),
(30752,11,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'No... this is worse than I could have possibly imagined. The monastery itself has been compromised...',27377),
(30768,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good. Looks like the rest of the Shado-Pan decided it was a good time to catch up.',27377),
(30769,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n. I hope you showed those cretins no mercy.',27377),
(30770,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ohohoho! I saw those animals trailing dust from up here.$B$BThose yaungol are probably still wondering what happened.',27377),
(30771,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It still smells fresh.$B$BGood job, $n.',27377),
(30772,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That should put a serious dent in their numbers.$B$BI doubt they will be able to recover from such losses.',27377),
(30773,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good, $c.$B$BNow that they cannot hide behind their siege weapons, they have no choice but to face us.',27377),
(30774,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am truly sorry to hear that Lin did not make it.$B$BSuna is taking the news quite hard. She will forgive me in time.$B$BAs for the rest of the Shado-Pan that you saved, well, I am very grateful to see them returned safe and sound.',27377),
(30775,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It pleases me to know those cowards died at your hands.$B$BPerhaps now, this burning tide in my heart will ebb.',27377),
(30776,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Jung Duk is dead at last.$B$BHundreds, perhaps thousands, lost their lives due to his violent aggression.$B$BThough they are not here to witness his demise, they owe deep gratitude to your bravery today.',27377),
(30777,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, we made it.',27377),
(30778,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work, $n.$B$BHopefully, their spirits are in a better place.',27377),
(30779,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. It was an unpleasant task, but it had to be done.',27377),
(30780,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I was right! These totems were once used to store and conduct immense magical energies.$B$BI do believe I can use them once again to do the same.',27377),
(30781,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for your help, $n.$B$BWe cannot know exactly what happened here, but it\'s clear that something caused the yaungol to turn on one another.$B$BWhat kind of power could do this?',27377),
(30782,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done. We cannot bring them retribution, but at least we can end their rage.',27377),
(30783,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you.$B$BThe sha preys upon the weak and the vulnerable.$B$BIf we are not vigilant, even the strongest of us can succumb to the sha\'s dark influence.',27377),
(30784,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What? She was possessed by the Sha of Hatred?$B$BNo. NO!$B$BDespite our differences, she was one of us. Today, the Shado-Pan has lost a dear sister.$B$BHer death will not be in vain. I will not rest until I have defeated the Sha of Hatred!$B$BSuna, I swear this to you!',27377),
(30785,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Did the northern expedition go well, then? What news do you have to report?',27377),
(30786,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am freed.$b$bThe yaungol must be stopped.',27377),
(30787,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This torch... the yaungol once used these to communicate with me, with my people.$b$bNow, they use them to undo us.',27377),
(30788,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Golgoss does not speak your language, other than a few words. I suppose I am unique in this regard.$b$bHe thanks you for summoning him.',27377),
(30789,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It will be difficult to lose with Arconiss by my side.',27377),
(30790,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We are one step closer to my goal.',27377),
(30791,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yet another step closer to completing my mission.',27377),
(30792,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I told you earlier, this wound would be my death. While you have bought me a bit more time, it is not long now.',27377),
(30793,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My name will be forgotten, but my actions will not.$b$bNor will yours, $n.',27377),
(30794,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you. I suppose... I\'ll need to ask you to do a bit more before I can return to the village. I cannot leave the bodies of my friends and family here.',27377),
(30795,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Very good! The relic works!$b$bIt appears there is more going on in the Valley of Emperors than I had anticipated. It is crucial we figure out why the Mogu are opening the tombs.',27377),
(30796,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have done them a great service, $n.$b$bIt is a cruel fate to be stuck between the living world and the afterlife.',27377),
(30797,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This text is curious indeed, $n...$b$bIt appears to have been written in the Meng dynasty, but some of the symbols are wrong. I don\'t think the Mogu wrote this, although it is oddly close.$b$bIt will take me some time to translate. Keep moving and see if you can find anything else.',27377),
(30798,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Mogu and the Zandalari intend to resurrect the Thunder King?!$b$bWe cannot let this happen, $n! The Thunder King will rain destruction on this land with his return. ',27377),
(30799,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These tablets recount the history of the Mogu and Zandalari alliance dating back to the time of the first Mogu emperor.$b$bBy the looks of things they have rekindled their alliance. But why now?',27377),
(30800,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We are fortunate they haven\'t gotten to Lei Shen\'s remains... yet.$b$bThe Zandalari will not give up until they have what they want. ',27377),
(30801,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They will need to move the remains to a secure location. We must go after them!',27377),
(30802,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is dark Zandalari blood magic. Once we\'re done with the map it should be burned.$b$bThe map indicates they have headed for the coast just outside of a tiny fishing village called Zouchin. The villagers there may be able to help us find the Zandalari. We just have to hope the village is still standing...',27377),
(30804,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yee haw! I knew you $rs might be good for somethin\'. He must of made a very satisfying "thump" when he hit the ground.',27377),
(30805,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ahh.. they are dead. Already, I can feel my spirits lifting. Soon I will have the strength to return to the village.',27377),
(30806,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Beautiful, beautiful. Better to not need to bury our friends, but if we must, it is good they will have a fitting ceremony.',27377),
(30807,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good. Thank you. After this, I cannot imagine leaving my fellows to less than a proper burial.',27377),
(30808,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hurray! Our Luckydos. Many thanks and fortune to friend of grummles!',27377),
(30814,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good. I can see that you are capable.$B$BI hope to rely on your talents for what is to come.',27377),
(30815,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'By removing this spear, I have truly guaranteed my own death.$b$bThis does not frighten me.$b$bI would sooner die than live carrying the weapon of my enemy.',27377),
(30816,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ahh... My cousin is wise to be worried... I am not well...',27377),
(30819,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see... it is tragic what has happened there. We will meet you at the graveyard to honor them.',27377),
(30820,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good. Let us begin the funeral.',27377),
(30827,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We look upon the true face of hatred!$B$BNow it all makes sense. This is the work of the sha.',27377),
(30828,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Mere... I can feel the corruption clearing. At least now, this corruption will not spread.\n\nBut, there is one more thing we must do.',63305),
(30829,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This must be a very powerful relic for Zuan to want it back so badly.$b$bIt frightens me to think of what else they may find in the tombs...',27377),
(30834,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You found him! This is all I have to give, but in finding my son, you have more than earned it.',63305),
(30855,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. You have assured that this corruption will not spread, and that my people - those who have not been corrupted - will be able to live on and found a new village. \n\nOur history will live on. You have done more for us than we could have ever hoped.\n\nThank you, friend.',63305),
(30884,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You look capable. Taran knows to send me the best. I like that.',27377),
(30887,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is where they\'re getting through, the eastern pass.',27377),
(30888,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There are more getting through than I thought. I may need to stay here and clean up a while.$B$BYou\'ve done more than your part though, $c. Thank you.',27377),
(30889,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We could use a few more capable $gmen:women; like you around the camp. Thank you for your help, $c.',27377),
(30890,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you. I\'ll have the new scouts at their posts shortly.',27377),
(30891,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Marvelous. And in good condition too!$B$BThank you, kind $c.',27377),
(30892,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There are several warriors that owe their lives to you. You have my deepest appreciation, $c.',27377),
(30893,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The men of the battlefront are growing to respect you. You clearly know how to fight.',27377),
(30894,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These are in great condition! Thank you, $n!$B$BYou know, I\'ve managed to distil some of their poison into a form that we can apply readily. I\'ve even come up with some methods for weaving it into spell-casting, if you believe it. Would you like to give some a try?',27377),
(30895,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s good to have a $c that I can count on.',27377),
(30896,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I guess you\'re a bit faster than me. Well, thanks.$B$BI\'ll try to finish collecting some orbs and get them back to camp while there\'s still some face to save.',27377),
(30897,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You... you are a lifesaver! Seriously.$B$BThank you so much!',27377),
(30898,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We\'re not done yet...',27377),
(30899,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There\'s a lot of movement on the other side of the chasm... something big is coming.',27377),
(30900,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You. You\'re coming with me.$B$BI\'ve never seen someone handle themselves on the battlefield like that. I need a strong $c like you with me when we face the Sha of Hatred.',27377),
(30901,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let\'s get this taken care of so we can get down to the bridge.',27377),
(30921,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The abundance of yak hair on that mantid\'s body suggests one thing... it came from Niuzao Temple. Our journey continues westward, $c.',27377),
(30922,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your messy work may have saved a few lives today, $r.',27377),
(30923,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We are in your debt, $r.',27377),
(30924,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your Shado-Pan associate has spoken with me. Yes, Niuzao knows why the mantid are attacking. But he is not ready to tell you.$b$bNot yet.',27377),
(30925,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Niuzao will be pleased.$b$bDespite his size, our patron is a beast of grace and compassion. He treasured this icon... just as he treasures each of his followers.',27377),
(30926,1,1,66,0,0,0,0,0,'Let me make this clear... that creature was NOT the Sha of Fear. Simply a shadow... a fraction of the sha\'s true power.$b$bNo, the Sha of Fear is with the mantid now. The elders of my order need to be informed of this immediately.$b$bI will handle the rest from here. Thank you for your assistance, $r. Once again, your kind proves to be an asset to Pandaria.',27377),
(30927,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $c.$b$b<Qipan sighs.>$b$bI should have been among them.',27377),
(30928,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We already have mantid, mogu, and yaungol to worry about. This sha problem needs to be nipped in the bud before even we are overrun.',27377),
(30929,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I think we made a pretty convincing argument. They\'ll HAVE to replace my yak now.',27377),
(30930,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, well! A good yak!$b$bTell you what, $n. I take this GOOD yak, and you can do whatever you want with this bad, bad one.',27377),
(30931,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yeah, this is dad\'s.$b$bLet\'s head on over to the temple. They\'ll know what...$b$b<Ku-Mo\'s voice catches.>$b$b...what happened to him.',27377),
(30932,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'No shield, no crossbow, no yak... something bad has happened to dad.',27377),
(30935,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The elders have agreed to help us figure out where the Zandalari have hidden the Thunder King\'s remains.$b$bThey have a few conditions though...',27377),
(30942,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I told you I was a fast learner! I will head back to the village to start training others. Thank you, $n.',27377),
(30943,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These are perfect! Now, I would go wash your hands a few times $c.$b$bI would also continue to avoid open flames for a few days...',27377),
(30944,2,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Very good, $c! With the villagers rested we may yet stand a chance against the Zandalari.',27377),
(30945,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, these are better than I had anticipated! I can make four spears for every one of their blades.$b$bDon\'t you worry, I\'ll make sure the villagers are armed when the time comes.',27377),
(30946,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We cannot dwell on this setback, $n. Prophet Khar\'zul must be dealt with.$b$bEvery member of the Thunder King\'s forces we are able to destroy brings us one step closer to victory.',27377),
(30960,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome back. I heard about the breaches in the eastern pass. It sounds like I put the right people on the job.',27377),
(30963,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent. I\'ll get to repairing the armor tonight, once most everyone\'s returned.',27377),
(30964,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These will do.$b$bThe Shado-Pan appreciates your work, $n.',27377),
(30967,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Though we may not seem like much, from these inauspicious beginnings I know we will rebuild. Thank you, friend.',63305),
(30968,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Defeating a Sha... is not an easy thing. It is a miracle that we came out of this unscathed.$B$BTaran still blames himself for letting his hatred get the best of him and setting this beast loose upon the land. It may take some time for him to come to terms with this, but it is important that he does, lest he be vulnerable again.$B$BWe accomplished a great thing this day, a thing that will not soon be forgotten.$B$BAnd neither shall you for your hand in this.  Thank you.',27377),
(30970,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good. What\'s left of the camp will be a bit safer.',27377),
(30971,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I... you... er, thank you. You didn\'t have to help, but you did. Thank you.',27377),
(30972,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Taran Zhu told me what became of my camp. I would have stopped it if I could, but the attacks from the bridge have not let up.$B$BThank you for bringing these arrows - my archers will make good use of them.',27377),
(30973,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We have the added benefit that the mantid will leave with broken morale after watching their brethren burn to death.  Grim, but many lives will be spared if they simply stop pressing our lines.',27377),
(30975,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The mantid aren\'t likely to return soon after a beating like that... and now Lao-Chin is free to join us in the hunt.',27377),
(30976,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We are close. I can feel the unnatural hatred surging.$B$BIt\'s a testament to the training of the Shado-Pan that the forces here have not been consumed by its influence.',27377),
(30977,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your efforts are appreciated, $c. Even a few more moment\'s breath between attacks are a relief these days.',27377),
(30978,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent shooting!$B$BI\'m pretty sure that big bug survived the fall though...',27377),
(30979,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Where have you been all my life?!  That was amazing!$B$BI\'d be proud to fight beside you any day.',27377),
(30980,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I like that I can always depend on you. You have the spirit of a true Shado-Pan.',27377),
(30981,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The first crystal is ours...',27377),
(30991,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Whoo, that was an explosion! Several, in fact.\n\nSad my beer had to go, but at least we\'re safe, for now.',27377),
(30992,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, their lieutenant is dead. I think we have finally pushed them out of Kun-Lai. \n\nBut at what cost? So many dead, Lin captured... I will not allow Taran Zhu to continue to ignore his charge.',27377),
(30993,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Here we are, and now you know why we cannot let our brothers sit idly by.',27377),
(30994,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good to see you made it back in one piece. Thanks to your help with the barrels, I\'ve managed to brew up a good surprise for our yaungol friends at the front.',27377),
(30999,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Travel to Seeker\'s Point will require much good fortune, $c. Hopefully you have many lucky trinkets!',27377),
(31001,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The fall wasn\'t that bad, actually. I\'ve always had a knack for soft landings.$B$BThat I landed on a pile of spider corpses probably helped, too.',27377),
(31002,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nice work with that dragon gun. I did what I could down here, but arrows are only so useful against these things.',27377),
(31003,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<This mantid is severely wounded. He barely manages to choke forth his words between wheezing gasps for breath.>$B$BHold, $r...$B$BWe are... not your enemy.',27377),
(31004,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Klaxxi... call to me.',27377),
(31005,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This will do.',27377),
(31006,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is a sacred meeting place for the Klaxxi.$B$BIt would be wise of you to let me do the talking.',27377),
(31007,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A few less traitors for us to feed to the kunchong when the dust settles.',27377),
(31008,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'If all goes as planned, the Klaxxi will stop the Empress without your help. Still, it is my role to be prepared.',27377),
(31009,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<As the crystal buzzes to life, a harsh mantid voice permeates your mind.>',27377),
(31010,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My slumber was interrupted by sudden dreams. Unspeakable nightmares.$B$BThen I awoke.$B$BThe Klaxxi have spoken to me. I have my orders. There is much to be done.',27377),
(31011,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Zandalari have started to retreat, $n. This victory will mean a great deal to the villagers.$b$bIn the chaos I was able to capture one of the fighters. Perhaps we can get information from him.',27377),
(31015,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah! Now that that is done we can start to place your collected research here. I look forward to seeing what you find.',27377),
(31019,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The whispers seem to be emanating from within this amber.$B$BCould there be another paragon sleeping within?',27377),
(31020,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I feel the strength returning to my body.',27377),
(31021,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, Wakener. That is enough for now.',27377),
(31022,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Once, great rivers of amber coursed through this tree\'s veins. Now, it is but a dried husk.',27377),
(31023,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These relics describe the history of Kypari Vos and the nearby amber trees.$B$BI would like to study these.$B$BThank you, $c.',27377),
(31026,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, Wakener. Kypari Zar can now dream in peace.$B$BHowever, the beast was merely a vessel for the corruption.$B$BNo... the true corruption lies much deeper.',27377),
(31032,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your help is appreciated, stranger.',27377),
(31063,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We have the second crystal then. Good.',27377),
(31064,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The final crystal is ours. We are on the doorstep of our final confrontation.',27377),
(31065,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Our tasks lay before us.',27377),
(31066,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What?! How did you...$B$BThe Deathcaller was a legendary hero. He must not have been fully wakened.$B$BYou are fortunate.',27377),
(31067,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We\'re not here to hurt anybody. We just want to make a little bit of brew out of this tree sap. Is that too much to ask?',27377),
(31068,483,1,0,0,0,5,0,0,'<Lya reads the entirety of the message.>$b$bThis scroll, this... this prophecy...$b$bIt\'s terrifying!',27377),
(31069,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Beautiful. This will make a fine addition to our brew.$b$bThe most dangerous ingredients are quite often the most delicious.',27377),
(31070,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I never thought of putting mushan teeth in a brew before.$b$bThat scroll\'s got some wacky ideas.',27377),
(31071,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have brought me joy, traveler.',27377),
(31072,25,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These daggers, look!$b$b<Lya holds the blades hilt-to-hilt.>$b$bThey were built to fit together! But how to join them...?',27377),
(31073,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ll get these pieces prepared.$b$bWe\'ve already gathered quite a few of these ingredients! I\'ll have to get a pot boiling soon.',27377),
(31074,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, look! The daggers - they\'ve bound together, into a forked blade.$b$bWe are on the right track. I knew this wasn\'t a beer recipe.',27377),
(31075,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s been a while since I brewed on the road.',27377),
(31077,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Chen is, for the moment, silent.>',27377),
(31078,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'First Evie, now Han.$b$bI was too late again.',27377),
(31079,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is good to have someone of your colossal size in our village.$b$bYou have many uses.',27377);
INSERT INTO `quest_offer_reward` (`ID`,`Emote1`,`Emote2`,`Emote3`,`Emote4`,`EmoteDelay1`,`EmoteDelay2`,`EmoteDelay3`,`EmoteDelay4`,`RewardText`,`VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(31080,15,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,'YEAH!!! FLITTERLING DUST!!!$b$b<Olon throws the powder into the pot.>$b$bThis brew is turning out... strange, and pretty smelly. I\'m starting to think maybe Lya was right.',27377),
(31081,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nice work. I\'ve heard the sprites talking about us.$b$bWe\'re getting their attention.',27377),
(31082,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, good. The motherseeds are taken care of.$b$bNow, we may speak of your enchantment.',27377),
(31084,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The blade is prepared.$b$bNow, only one task remains: you must use it.',27377),
(31085,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There was a... a mantid inside that amber? I never would have thought that the solution to our war on the mantid would be... another mantid.$b$bThere are still many things that I have left to learn, but I do know this: that CERTAINLY wasn\'t a beer recipe.',27377),
(31086,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That should do it! Recipe... complete.$b$bNow let\'s see how this beer tastes.',27377),
(31087,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is good you showed up when you did.$b$bPerhaps you are not as useless as I thought...$b$bThe Klaxxi\'va sing to the paragon now. Soon they will know where to send you. For now there are other tasks.',27377),
(31088,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Klaxxi are pleased with our work, outsider. You have proven to be more resourceful than we thought.',27377),
(31089,64,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What... what sort of creature are you?$b$bHow have you awoken me?',27377),
(31090,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Even this raw amber will be of use. We can\'t afford to be picky in times like these.$b$bThe Klaxxi\'va will be glad I thought of this. I will tell them you helped!',27377),
(31091,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Kovok is just as impressive as the last time I saw him. He will ensure great victories for the Klaxxi.',27377),
(31092,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Very good! I had half expected Kovok to just eat you. What a pleasant surprise to see you both in one piece.$b$bPerhaps Kunchong raising is in your blood.',27377),
(31107,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They are large. They will hatch soon.$B$BGood. We may need them.',27377),
(31108,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What would happen, I wonder, if you ate one? What would it do to your soft, pink insides?',27377),
(31110,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent! Excellent!$B$BThis is just the stuff, $n.$B$BWe\'ll get to work right away. I have no doubt we\'ll be done very soon.',27377),
(31112,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Look at that!$b$bThese supplies should keep us kickin\' for a few more days.$b$bAnd my boots! Ya managed not to blow \'em up. Way ta go, $n!',63305),
(31121,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I will help you, traveler, but first I would like to learn a little about this Horde of yours...',63305),
(31129,1,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Chen listens intently.>$b$bBig Dan, Han, Evie, and Mama. I understand.$b$bIt seems like Dan will be safe here. I will go look for Evie, Han, and Mama Stormstout.$b$bTake care, $n.',27377),
(31130,1,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Despite your many years of combat, you\'ve still got an eye for beauty, $n. I like that about you!$B$BNow, let\'s find this missing prince of yours.',27326),
(31132,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I suppose the best way to explain what a Lorewalker is all about is to show you...',63305),
(31133,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve got the makings of a fine brewgarden guard, $r. Let me know if you ever get tired of the whole "$c" thing.',27377),
(31134,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That is enough translating for one day, I think.$b$bThis experience has been an enlightening one, I hope.',63305),
(31152,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am most grateful for the knowledge my forebears have passed on to me.$b$bI stand upon their shoulders.',63305),
(31167,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Not so different, you and I.$b$bI believe we can become good friends.',63305),
(31175,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The hunger... they said it would be fierce, but I did not expect anything like this.$B$BIt is strange to feel so... weak.',27377),
(31176,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, give it here! Well done, Wakener.',27377),
(31177,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent. This shall give me the strength to vanquish my foes.',27377),
(31178,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, this will do.',27377),
(31179,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have succeeded once again. Well done, Wakener.',27377),
(31181,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Not bad, green, not bad.',27377),
(31182,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That should keep their little whiskers out of our traps for awhile.',27377),
(31183,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'New deckhand, eh? We\'ll see about that.$B$BI run a tight ship - even if she IS at the bottom of the sea.',27377),
(31184,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s the charter tube, alright. I guess you\'d like to know what all the fuss is about, eh?$B$B<Soggy lets out a long sigh as he un-caps the tube.>$B$BMight as well get it over with.',27377),
(31185,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'How did it go? I hope he didn\'t cause too much trouble!',27377),
(31186,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Dog licks his chops happily, looking satisfied.>',27377),
(31187,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nice work out there!',27377),
(31188,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Those are perfect, just put them down over there. I\'d rather not touch them myself. Creeps me out.',27377),
(31189,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What happened out there?! I heard a scream and next thing I know these nasty things come rolling in on the next wave!',27377),
(31190,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nice shooting out there!$B$BI knew we could do it. Never met anything that can\'t be killed with enough harpoons.',27377),
(31228,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These events should be learned from, $n.$b$bIt is important that we learn from our history. Had we paid attention to the histories, we may have been able to head this off before it got this far.$b$bEverything that has happened was already foretold, we just didn\'t know how to read it.',27377),
(31230,1,1,404,0,0,500,500,0,'Good, good, good. You\'re going to fit right in.',63305),
(31239,71,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ha ha! Wikket Grooked ookin\' Jinyu!',63305),
(31241,71,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wikket grookin\' makin\' hozen rich with shinies!$b$b$n makin\' a good second impression. And for hozen, number two is most important!',63305),
(31252,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did good, bringing these guys back. We\'ll have \'em farming you up some food in no time!',27377),
(31254,2,1,0,0,0,500,0,0,'Oh, you are a friend of Cho\'s? Welcome! Welcome!$b$bI would serve you a banquet but as you can see we are in dire straights at the moment.$b$bSay, would you be willing to lend us a hand?',27377),
(31255,2,1,0,0,0,500,0,0,'Oh, you are a friend of Cho\'s? Welcome! Welcome!$b$bI would serve you a banquet, but as you can see, we are in dire straights at the moment.$b$bSay, would you be willing to lend us a hand?',63305),
(31260,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Impressive! Can you smell the money? Here\'s your end.',27366),
(31261,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ookin\' grookin, wikket!',63305),
(31262,4,1,0,0,0,500,0,0,'Now THAT is a trophy. Looks intimidating. Wait... is this your blood on it?',27366),
(31265,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ll thank me later.',27377),
(31285,1,1,0,0,0,500,0,0,'Wheh, we made it. Welcome to Binan Village.',63305),
(31286,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, our merchandise. Madam Goya will be pleased. You have the gratitude of her ladyship. ',63305),
(31287,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The deed is done and a debt must be paid. Here is your reward. You have our gratitude.',63305),
(31291,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wow! You got the pieces to meld together so well. The quality of this restoration is amazing.$b$bHow did you do it?',18414),
(31303,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I have much research to do in very little time.$b$bThe emperor\'s message only warned of the unique threat war would bring to our land - this... Sha.$b$bSadly, the time to heed his message has passed. And as for how to bring an end to the crisis, the Emperor\'s Omen is silent.',27326),
(31319,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My thoughts will be with your fallen companions, traveler.$b$bMay their wounds mend well.',27326),
(31354,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hey there!$B$BOh, I\'m fine. I\'ve had worse spills than that after a night at the Chum Bucket.$B$BBut would you look at this thing? I spotted it peeking out of the sea floor when I went under - Jiao must have dredged it up while he was thrashing around.$B$BNot really sure what to do with it, but it looks valuable. Seeing as how you pretty much saved all our hides, I think we owe you this catch.',27377),
(31359,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am most impressed with your progress, Wakener. Kovok\'s training is coming along nicely and he seems to be fond of you.$b$bI have no doubt that you are the best choice to assist me in training him.',27377),
(31362,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Lorewalker Cho shudders, in spite of himself.>$b$bThe legends... they\'re true!',27326),
(31384,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Grim times, $c. We welcome any help you have to offer.',27377),
(31392,396,5,0,0,0,500,0,0,'$C, I\'m glad you\'re here! The "Vale of Eternal Blossoms" is legendary among the Pandaren. It\'s a place of great healing, if the locals are to be believed.$b$bBut the Horde Warchief has done something to the Vale - something terrible.$b$bWe need to get in there!',27377),
(31393,396,396,6,0,0,500,500,0,'Hello, $c! We have been granted an audience with the White Tiger. The Vale of Eternal Blossoms was recently savaged by our Warchief, and we are arguing that both the Alliance and Horde should be permitted back inside to repair the damage.$b$bThe Vale is a sacred place. I believe my wife Leza saw it in a vision - it\'s what brought my people to Pandaria. We must save it!$b$bDo you think we will be allowed inside?',63305),
(31394,5,396,0,0,0,500,0,0,'You did it, $n!$b$bThe White Tiger has agreed to allow us to accompany the Pandaren into the Vale of Eternal Blossoms. An Alliance outpost is already set up within. Now, the hard work of cleaning up the damage can begin!',27377),
(31398,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You were wise to bring this to us. This is a piece of another paragon\'s encasing amber.$b$bThe damage suggests the paragon may be in trouble.$b$bI will speak with the council to decide what should be done next.',27377),
(31443,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Is that a flying tiger gourami?$b$bThis little fish is a rare mutation of the tiger gourami that can fly, and are consequently caught in any freshwater here in Pandaria.$b$bLocal legend states that good luck comes to the person who eats it, and local tradition states that only royalty can eat them.  To be caught breaking this "tradition" is a death sentence.$b$bWith that in mind, I\'ll make sure it gets to the right person.',18414),
(31444,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s not what I think it is, is it?  Oh wow, a spinefish alpha, one of Pandaria\'s deadliest predators.$b$bSpinefish are malformed abominations created by the sha presence, and these big ones are simply terrifying.  An alpha will often eat other spinefish, even though there isn\'t a single part of them that\'s edible.$b$bLuckily for both of us, they are very interesting to alchemists.\n\n',18414),
(31446,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Is that a mimic octopus?  A buddy of mine caught one of these off the coast of Zandalar a few years back.  He barely made it back alive, actually.  Pesky trolls, but great fishing!$b$bAnyhow, they aren\'t as rare as you might think because they use camouflage to hide amongst rocks and plants; only a very skilled fisherman has any hope of catching this elusive, and delicious, morsel.\n\n',18414),
(31455,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Who are you? Can you fight? If so, we can use your help.',27377),
(31456,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wha? Who the heck are you? What are you doin\' here?\n\nOh, you wanna help?',27377),
(31460,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, hello. Nice to see you again.',27377),
(31486,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My, that\'s so thoughtful. I love hearing from my old students.',27356),
(31512,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to the Shrine of Seven Stars.$B$BI wish I could bring you better tidings, $c, but the situation here in the Vale is quite dire.$B$BThere is much to do, but first, rest and explore the city.$B$BWelcome to the Vale.',27377),
(31605,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<From the looks of it, this mantid was just recently broken out of his chamber. He lets out a hacking cough.>$B$B...Diss-ec...tor... has... returned...',27377),
(31606,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Look at you! Many parts and pieces... yes... and all of them so good at killing. Fascinating.$B$BI must pick your brain some time. Muhahah.',27377),
(31660,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Their eggs should have basked in the warmth of the sun and the song of a million wings for ten more years.$B$BThe Empress will pay for her crimes.',27377),
(31661,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Do you have any idea what this is? It\'s amber!$B$BBut it is polluted with fear.$B$BI would not expect an outsider like you to understand the consequences of this.',27377),
(31676,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We have a common enemy in the mogu. And perhaps others.$B$BWe shall see.',27377),
(31687,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The mantid are relentless. Fortunately for us, you have a dedication that surpasses even theirs.$B$BIt is good to have you walk these roads, $c.',27377),
(31688,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Leng told me of your heroics. He is in your debt, as am I.',27377),
(31689,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'In disciplined hands, the spear is the perfect weapon. Only the weak would augment it with sorcery.$B$BAnd we have no need for the weak.',27377),
(31727,6,5,0,0,0,3,0,0,'So the bugs have taken an interest in us have they? Well if they want somethin\' from us they\'ll have to come and earn it themselves!$b$bYou work for what you get here. That means you too!',27377),
(31730,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So they want us to leave do they? What a selfish request! We\'re only taking amber from one tree.$b$bWell, I\'m not going anywhere! I have brew to make.$b$bIf you help us maybe we can all come to a mutually beneficial agreement. I give them some brew, they stop trying to kill us.',27377),
(31732,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A proper welcome for the Horde to this new land!',27326),
(31733,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'\'Bout time you showed up, $Gladdy:lassie;! Let\'s do some damage!',27326),
(31734,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With those wagons out of commission, we can turn our attention to the commander.',27326),
(31735,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We\'ll catch up with him again. I\'m sure of it.',27326),
(31736,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'When the mist fell, we knew it would only be a matter of time before visitors arrived.$B$BWe could not have predicted it would be like this.',27326),
(31737,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am glad you took responsibility for your actions. Left unchecked, negative emotions can quickly overwhelm an individual here, just as they started to overwhelm the one you call "Rell."',27326),
(31738,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Our orchard is one of our village\'s greatest treasures. For saving our harvest, we are truly grateful.',27326),
(31739,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see that you two have been busy. Thank you for recovering our kegs.',27326),
(31740,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did well to help the Brewers and bring this news to me.$B$BFrom what you have told me, it sounds as if Koukou was possessed by some dark energy. Could it be...?$B$BNo. That is impossible.',27326),
(31741,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'One heck of a bloody mess y\'made down there, kid.$b$bNice work.',27326),
(31742,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s some fine and fancy killin\', $c.$b$bNow, with those two all done \'n\' taken care of, all that\'s left is the big fella in the hall behind me.',27326),
(31743,11,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Me lads up in the sky bring the heat, don\'t they? Ha ha ha!',27326),
(31744,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Aye, I seen the wee ones, too. Busted a few out on m\'way up here.$b$bYe\'ve done good, $glad:lass;. Those cubs might have some nasty nightmares, but they\'ll grow up some day, thanks to you.',27326),
(31745,1,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $c. I can see why you came so highly recommended.',27326),
(31765,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Superior Horde firepower at its finest!$B$B...and you did okay too I guess.',63305),
(31766,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There you are!$b$bI was starting to worry we\'d have to charge in and have all the fun without you.',63305),
(31767,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work, $c! We have them on their heels!',63305),
(31768,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Haha! Good work, $n.$b$bLeave \'em nothing!',63305),
(31769,1,1,0,0,0,500,0,0,'An air base - they had a hidden airbase here this entire time! Had I known I would\'ve kept more men on the guns, I would\'ve - Uaaghh -$b$b<The color drains from Nazgrim\'s face, and his body begins to exude a mysterious dark energy.>',63305),
(31770,5,274,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Your fighting has brought about much destruction for our tiny village!$b$bWe have no interest in your war, but we will not turn your injured away.',63305),
(31771,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am glad you took responsibility for your actions. Left unchecked, negative emotions can quickly overwhelm an individual here, just as they started to overwhelm the one you call "Nazgrim."',63305),
(31772,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, it\'s not as much as I would have hoped, but it will have to do. I guess there is no sense in cryin\' over spilled brew.',63305),
(31773,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, so your conflict at the ruins is beginning to pollute the local wildlife? This is very troubling - I have never seen a reaction so intense.$b$bThank you for protecting the village, but it is a tragedy that those poor animals had to die.',63305),
(31774,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Zin\'Jun is grievously wounded, but senses that you\'re friendly.>$b$bMonkey-tings! Everywhere dere be dese monkey-tings!',63305),
(31775,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The best thing about killing Alliance in Pandaria? It\'ll be months before they get any reinforcements.$b$bThis land will belong to the Horde, $c. We\'re nearly finished.',63305),
(31776,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Blood and thunder, $n. Blood and thunder.',63305),
(31777,11,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I hope those ding-dongs enjoyed the party you threw for them!',63305),
(31778,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Although I can\'t understand why you chose to bring your war to our land, I can clearly see which side is more virtuous.$b$bThank you for your aid, $r.',63305),
(31779,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Alliance have been routed. You, Nazgrim, Kiryn, Gorrok, Shokia, and Rivett need a base of operations.$b$bThese flags will have to be changed.$b$bFor the Horde!',63305),
(31782,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We are... undone, wakener.$b$bYour efforts appear to have become imperative to our cause.$b$bOn behalf of the remaining council, I implore you to continue in your assistance.',27377),
(31805,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This will aid lorewalkers and archaeologists in understanding the history of Pandaria.',18414),
(31809,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<As you present the Claw to Ban, his eyes grow wide with the realization of what you have done.>\n\nI see now what about you has changed.\n\nYou have done the impossible. The Shado-Pan shall record your name, and honor it as long as we stand watch over this land.',27377),
(31894,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Orbiss groans at you in agony.>$b$bSo, the shado-pan have sent you to see what the yaungol are doing? Well, do you see?',27377),
(31945,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, I\'ll be! I\'ve certainly seen larger scallions, but this will do quite nicely. You\'ve just saved our hides, $n!',27366),
(31999,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We may have won the battle against the Alliance, but we won\'t get any further with this many jabbering monkeys on our perimeter.$b$bThe hozen are our next target.',63305),
(32018,11,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ha ha! You were sent by Bolo? The "Keg Mender," right? From the Drunken Hozen?$b$bHow is his eye healing? Is his friend still hung over?$b$bAhh... that was an enjoyable evening.',19342),
(32030,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your arrival is timely, wakener.$b$bOur ritual is underway.',27377),
(32035,2,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Greetings, $c. Welcome to the Silken Fields.',19342),
(32038,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I haven\'t seen stag hunting this good since Ashenvale.',27366),
(32045,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let this be a lesson to you: don\'t drink too much of the water.$b$bWhy do you think we have such a big brewery?',27356),
(32109,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Blue sails are barely visible on the horizon - the full might of the Alliance fleet, awaiting one final signal.>',27377),
(32190,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well met, $c. We are an archaeological expedition, sent to excavate these ruins. We had no idea that this area was crawling with dangerous mogu.',63305),
(32246,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have impeccable timing, $c. King Wrynn is just about to land, and the full might of our fleet will follow soon after.',27377),
(32256,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What do you have to report?',63305),
(32284,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah! You received my note. Very good. Vol\'jin is near death, and I will need your help healing his wounds.',63305),
(32326,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n! So glad Nazgrim selected you.$b$bIt\'s taken a great deal of the Horde\'s effort to get you here through Jaina\'s traps. Maintaining our illusion this close to Darnassus is considerably expensive.$b$bFurthermore, the Sunreavers of Dalaran are risking their neutrality by assisting the Horde with this operation.$b$bIn other words, we expect only the best from you.',63305),
(32328,1,1,66,0,0,0,0,0,'You found the bell! And Fanlyr teleported it to Silvermoon for study, as instructed? The Horde will put this to good use.$b$bYou have done the Horde a great service today. Lok\'tar, friend!',63305),
(32329,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Warchief "demands" progress? His impatience is growing more destructive with each command.$b$bAs it stands, we could use your expertise.',63305),
(32351,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well met, $c. You were sent from Domination Point? Very well. We have much to discuss.',63305),
(32363,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for coming, $n.',63305),
(32376,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, good. You have come. \n\nAgain, I apologize for the cryptic note - but Garrosh is increasingly distrustful of us. I do not want this operation disturbed by hasty action on his part.',63305),
(32391,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Alliance beat us here. How could this happen?',63305),
(32402,2,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Good... you\'ve arrived. It\'s not a good day to be Horde in Dalaran.$b$bJaina\'s called for the exile of all the Sunreavers. You and I are going to save as many as we can - including Archmage Aethas Sunreaver himself - and then get out of here as fast as possible.',63305),
(32681,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have arrived just in time, $n. This land needs to be controlled by the Kirin Tor for everyone\'s safety. This will not be an easy task.',44730),
(33211,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is the great burden of the Historian - should Azeroth\'s timeways come under attack, we must reconstruct history exactly as it happened, or the consequences could be dire. As we spread our stories and knowledge, so do we create a stronger future for us all.',18414);
